<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Uamusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu su Uamusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uamusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uamu</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kitabu sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uamusi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongule</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu senze kilandi majambu ga akakilongosi buku Izilaeli babakema Aamusi baada jukugukamu nndema uku Kanani. Mu kipindi se hesi Aizalaleli babiya akelubuki kambelikambeli kunkana Bambu Sapanga na Sapanga jwabiya ngasejukotwiki kwaakombo Aizalaeli. Aizalaeli batumbuliya kuitumaki isapanga yengi na Sapanga jaahenga bandu bi milema jengi baang'alisa. Ndienu bandu buku Izalaeli balela nu kunkelubuki Bambu Sapanga, henu Sapanga jwaahaguliya akakilongosi babaakema Aamusi babube babiya baalongosa nu kwaahoko Aizalaeli kuhuma kwa bandu bababiya atenda kwaang'alisa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngamundu jojumanyiki jojuandiki kitabu senze. Bandu bingi ba mwandi ahobale kubanga kiandikwi nu nndota Samweli, lakini tuwesa kuba nu usakaka kubanga kiandikwi kipindi Aizalaeli abi na bambu nkolongu, ndaba kitabu seni kilandi kubanga sabi kipindi Aizalaeli ngasebabii na bambu nkolongu 17:6 na 18:1 na 19:1 na 21:25. Ngati ana Aizalaeli baboka ku nndema uku Misili mu yaka ya 1400 kabula jukusaliwa Kilisitu, ndienu gala gagahengiki mu kitabu senze sa Aamusi gaandikwi mu yaka ya 1300 kabula jukusaliwa Kilisitu mbaka ku yaka 1050 kabula jukusaliwa, kipindi sesuse bambu nkolongu Sauli jatenda kulongosa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ja 1-3:6 jilandi bandu buku Izilaeli ebakomana na Akanani baada ja kuwa Joshua. Ahelahe jitumbuli kulandi kipindi sa Aamusi pala Bambu Sapanga pajwaahagula akikilongosi babalongusa nukwaahoko Aizalaeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ja 3:7-16:31 jilandi kabee Bambu Sapanga ejaahagula Aamusi kwaajangati bandu buku Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kabee kitabu senze kilandi kihakau sengi sebahenga Aizalaeli su kunkana Bambu Sapanga. Mu sula ja 17-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Bandu bilikabila la Yuda na Simoni bunkamu bambu nkolongu Adonibezeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Baada ja kuwa kwaka Joshua Aizilaeli bunndalukia Bambu Sapanga, “Likabila boo leliilongulia kujenda kukomana na Akaanane?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Likabila laka Yuda ndi leliilongulia kujenda, numpeki nndema hogu gubia wabu.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Ndi bandu bi likabila laka Yuda baapwagila alongu babu bi likabila la Simeoni, “Bajenda pamu na twepani mu nndema gobutupeki, ili tuwesa kukomana na Akaanani. Twepani kabee twiijenda pamu na mwanganya pandu pii pabumpeki.” Ndi bandu bi likabila la Simeoni bajenda pamu nabombi. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ndienu, bandu bilikabila la Yuda bajenda kukomana, najombi Bambu Sapanga jaajangatiya kwaawesa akanani na Apelizi, nabombi baakoma bandu elupu komi buku Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Mu musi we hogu bunketania bambu nkolongu Adoni Bezeki, bakomana najombi na kwaawesa Akanani na Apelizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Bambu nkolongu Adoni Bezeki kabee jwatenda kutila nabombi bumpwatalia nukunkamu nu kunseku ngonzi igumba yumu maboku ni igumba yumu magolu. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Adoni Bezeki japwaaga, “Sapanga jutei kunepa ndaba pamwandi naakamula aka bambu akolongu sabini, naasekula ngonzi yumu lugumba yumu maboku na mumagolu na nalasimisa kula posu jejihigali jejihabuki pai ja mesa jangu.” Ndienu bumpelika ku Yelusalemu najombi jatenda kuwa hoku.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila la Yuda laawesa bandu ba musi uku Yelusalemu nuku Ebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Bandu bi likabila la Yuda bakomana na bandu ba musi uku Yelusalemu nukugukamu musi wabu. Baakoma bandu ba musi hogu na kwaatini tipitipi kwa mwotu.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Baada ja haga bandu bi likabila la Yuda bajenda kukomana na Akaanani bababia atama mu nndema ututombi, upandi ukusini na punndema wanga ni tutombi. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Bandu likabila la Yuda bajenda bakomana na Akaanani bababia atama ku Hebuloni goguwe bugukemika Kiliati Alaba, hoku baawesa bandu bu lukolu lwa Sheshati na Himani na Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alonda baka Otinieli baawesa bandu buku musi uku Debili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Joshua 15:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kuhuma hoku bandu bi likabila la Yuda bajenda kukomana na bandu bababia atama ku Debili, musi wehogu pamwandi gwabia bugukema Kiliati Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Ndienu Kalebu japwaaga, “Mundu jojwaawesa Akiliati Sefeli nampekia kamwali wangu Akisa jubia nhwanu waki.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Ndi Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi nnuna waka Kalebu jwatenda kugukamu musi, najombi Kalebu ampekia kamwali waki jobunkema Akisa kuba nhwanu waka Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa pajwahika kwaka Otinieli ampwagila anndoba litui Kalebu atati baka Akisa. Akisa jabia jukwei pi liponda na pajwahuluka kuhuma panani ji liponda laki Kalebu anndalukia, “Boo nukuhengila kike?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Jajibua, “Noba gumbekiya nhupi jengi ngani. Ndaba gumbeki nndema gu upandi u Kusini, kabee noba mmbekia pandu papabii na kalosi.” Kalebu ampekia pandu papabii na kalosi kapanani na kapai.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini gatenda kuwesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Akenani babube babia ibeleku ya akohanu baka Musa, balongana na bandu buku Yuda kuhuma ku musi wi mitendi, yaani musi uku Yeliku, mpaka lukoba lwa Yuda pambipi nuku Aladi, nabombi batama kola. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Ndienu bandu buku Yuda bajenda na alongu babu bandu bi likabila la Simeoni kukomana na Akanani baatama ku musi uku Sefati nabombi bugualabana musi gola woti tipitipi. Ndi musi gola bugukema Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Ahelahe kabee bandu bi likabila la Yuda bakamula musi uku Gaza, na musi uku Ashikeloni na musi uku Ekiloni, na kila musi ni mipaka jaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Bambu Sapanga jwaajangatia bandu bi likabila Yuda. Bugukamula nndema wi itombi lakini ngasebawesike kwaabenga bandu babatama mu nndema guubamba gola, ndaba babia na magali gabu ga ngondu gabiya gi isomasoma gukuhutwa ni inyama yebiikema falasi. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Musi uku Ebuloni, bumpekiya Kalebu kulengana na malagalaki gaka Musa. Kalebu ndi jojabenga bandu bu lukolu itatu yaka Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Lakini bandu bi likabila la Benjamini basindwa kwaabenga Ayebusi bababia atama Yelusalemu, mbaka lelenu Ayebusi atama momu pamu na bandu bi likabila la Benjamini.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila laka Epulaimu na Manase buguwesa musi uku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Ndienu bandu bi likabila laka Josepu bakomana na bandu ba musi uku Beseli, najombi Bambu Sapanga jwabia jutenda kwaajangati. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Pabaatuma bandu kujenda kulaluki majambu guku musi guku Beseli gogugwe pa mwandi bugukema Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Bandu baalaluki majambu bala bumbona mundu juhuma kumusi, nabombi bumpwagila, “Tulangia namuna jukujingi ku musi na twepani ngatwagukomi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ndienu jwalangia indela jukujingi ku musi, nabombi bunkoma kila mundu, lakini bunndeka mwomi mundu jola na alongu baki boti. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mundu jola jwajenda mbaka ku nndema ja Ahiti, kokuje juusenga musi nu kugukema Luzu, lelule ndi liina la musi hogu mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli ngasebaabengiki bandu bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Lakini bandu bi likabila la Manase ngase baabenga bandu buku Beti Sheni ni ijiji yaki na bandu buku Taanaki ni ijiji yaki, na bandu buku Doli niijiji yaki na bandu buku Ibileamu ni ijiji yaki na bandu buku Magidu ni ijiji yaki lakini Akaanani baendalia kutama mu ijiji hei. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Aizilaeli pabajonzukika na kuba na makili, ngasebaabengiki Akaanani ila baalasimisa baahengila mahengu ngati atumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Bandu bi likabila la Efulaimu ngase baabengiki Akaanani bababia atama ku musi Gezeli na Akaanani haba baendalia kutama momu pamu na bandu bi likabila la Efulaimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Helahela Bandu bi likabila la Zebuloni ngasebaabenga Akaanani bababia atama ku musi uku Kituloni, wala bababia atama ku musi uku Nahaloli, babube babaendaliya kutama pamu na bombi koni baahengesa mahengu ngati atumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wala bandu bi likabila la Asheli ngasebaabenga bandu bababia atama ku musi uku Ako nuku musi uku Sidoni nuku musi uku Ahilabu nuku musi uku Akizibu nuku musi uku Heluba nuku musi Afeki wala nuku musi uku Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Ahelahe kabe bandu bi likabila laka Asheli batama pamu na Akaanani benei bu nndema gola.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Nabombi bandu bi likabila la Nafutali ngase baabenga bandu bababiya atama ku Beti Shemeshi wala baatama ku Beti Anati, lakini batama pamu nabombi. Hata hela Nafutali jaahengisa benei ba misi jela mahengu ngati atumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Bandu bi likabila la Aamoli baabenga bandu bi likabila la Dani ku nndema u tutombi na wala ngasebaaleka ahuluka kujingi pandu panga nu tutombi. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Bandu bi likabila la Aamoli baendalia kutama mu misi jejibi mu tutombi tuku Helesi na Aiyaloni na Shaalubimu. Lakini bandu ba makabila gaka Manase na Efulaimu pabajonzukika kuba bingi nakuba na makili baawesa Aamoli, na kwaahenga ahenga mahengu ngati atumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mpaka wa Aamoli wabia ku kasikasini juku Sela, kupete pandu pukulobuke pabapakema kipelela.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Ntumi ju kunani ku musi uku Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Ntumi jukunani jwaboka ku Giligali kujenda ku Bokimu na kwaapwagi Aizilaeli, “Numpia mu nndema uku Misili nu kunndeta ku nndema gonaalagila akahoku binu sukulapa. Napwaaga ‘nga niitunu hata kulenga lilaganu langu lemei pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Na mwanganya mwiihenga lilaganu na bandu bu nndema gongo ila mwiibombula mesa yukupiiki matambiku yabu.’ Lakini mwanganya ngase mwanyetaki nepani. Ndaba jaki nhengiki lijambu hele? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Henu numpwagi ana, nga naabengi kabe benei baatama mu nndema gongo aboka kwinu ila biibia kikobando kwinu, nanamu mwailumbalia isapanga yabu.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Ntumi jukunani pajwajomula kwaapwagi haga Aizilaeli boti, bandu haba batumbulia kulela sukujamali ngamaa. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Bapakema pandu pala Bokimu mana jaki kilelu. Nabombi bumpiikia Bambu Sapanga matambiku gukutinii.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Joshua jaatabuka Aizilaeli, kila jumu jwajenda pandu paki pabumpeki pabia paki.<verse eid="JDG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Masoba goti Joshua pajabia mwomi, bandu buku Izilael baendalia kuntumaki Bambu Sapanga. Masobagoti gababia atama akakilongosi bababia ahigali na bababia bagabweni mahengu makolongu gaka Sapanga gajwaahengi Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Joshua mwana waka Nuni, jojuwe ndi ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga jwakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia jimu na komi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Buntaga ku nndema waki, ku musi uku Timuna Helesiku mu nndema gogubi ni itombi juku Efulaimu ku kasikazini ku nndema uku Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Kibeleku soti sela satei kuwa, ni kibeleku sesapwatila ngasesummanyiki Bambu Sapanga wala mahengu gaki gajwaahengi bandu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli akotoka kunndumbali Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Ndienu Aizilaeli bahenga majambu gilia palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga na kwiilumbambali isapanga yengi yebiikema Baali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Bakotuka kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa atati babu, jojwabia jwaapiiki mu nndema uku Misili. Baamua kuipwata nu kuilumbali isapanga ndalindali yu nndema yeyaayongolota. Ndienu bunhenga Bambu Sapanga juyoma, <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />ndaba bunndeka jombi nu kundumbali Baali na Maashitoleti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jaayomila bandu buku Izilaeli, kabee jwagaleka majangili gaanyaga mali gabu. Jwaakabisa kwa abaja babu babayongaliti na ngasebawesa kabee kwaalenda. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kila pabajenda kukomana, Bambu Sapanga jakotuka kwaajangati kwa makili gaki na kwaalete mang'aliku ngati ejabiya jwaalakali na kwaalapi. Nabombi babia nu usungu nu kuhangajika ngamaa mioju jabu.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jaahaguliya baatemu babube baokua mu ulongosi wa bandu bababiya baanyagiki mali gabu. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Lakini ngasebaajowana hata aka kilongosi haba babaakema Ahamusi, sukundeka Sapanga nukulumbali isapanga yengi. Bang'anambuka nu kuileka indela yebabia apwata akahoku babu, yani indela yukuijetake miilu jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Kila kipindi Bambu Sapanga pajwaapekia mundu jukutemu Bambu Sapanga jwabia pamu na mundu hoju, najombi jwaahokula kuhuma mu ulonda wa abaja babu ku kipindi soka sejwabia punndema jojutemu jola. Bambu Sapanga jwaabonila ikia ndaba kulela kwabu ku usungu kwabia kutenda kwang'alisa na kwaajima sebapalika kupata. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Lakini kila jojutemu kipindi pajukuwa, bandu bakelabukia majambu gabu ga mwandi atamika su ubaja kupeta akatati babu. Biipwata isapanga yengi biitumakiya nukuigungamali wala ngasebakotwiki mahengu gabu gu ubaja. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ndienu Sapanga jwaayomila ngamaa Aizilaeli nukupwaga, “Kwa ndaba bandu haba atunwii Lilaganu lenahenga na akatati babu na ngasebanyowani, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />nepani nganaabengi bandu bu nndema gongo bajwaaleka Joshua kabula ja kuwa. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Naatumia bandu bi milema jengi heji kwaalenga Aizilaeli ili mona ana mbaka bijikelubuki indela jangu ngati akahoku babu au boo.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jwabia jwaaleka bandu bi milema jengi jela wala ngasejwaabenga kanyata wala ngasejajetaki Joshua jaawesa.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Bandu ba makabila babaigali mu nndema uku Kaanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Bamba ndi bandu bajwaaleka Bambu Sapanga ili kwaapema Aizilaeli boti bababia ngaseawaiki kukomana ngondu jokapi mu nndema uku Akaanani, <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />jwahenga hela ili pe kwiibola ibeleku ya Aizilaeli kukomana ngondu yeyabia ngaseawaiki kukomana pa mwandi. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Jaaleka Afilisti bababii pai jaka akabambu akolongu nhwanu na Akaanani boti na Asidoni na Ahivi baatama mu itombi yuku Lebanoni kutumbuli kitombi sa Baali Helimoni mbaka Lebo Hamoti. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Baaleka bandu ba nndema heji ili kwaapema Aizilaeli ana biijetakia miilu jaka Bambu Sapanga yejwabia jwaapeki akahoku babu kupete Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Aizilaeli batama pamu na Akaanani na Ahiti na Aamoli na Apelizi na Ahivi na Ayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Baajukua akakamwali babu kuba akahanu babu, nabombi baaboa akakamwali babu abia akahanu babu bandu bi milema jela na kabee nukuitumaki isapanga yabu.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otenieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Aizilaeli bahenga majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, bunzegwa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wabu nukuitumaki imong'umong'u Baali na Maashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jayomi ngamaa Aizilaeli, najombi anhenga bambu nkolongu Kushani Lishataimu juku Mesopotania jaalapula, nabombi batenda kuntumaki kwa yaka nani. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Ndienu Aizilaeli pabunndelila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwaahagulia mundu jwakaakombula, Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi nnuna waka Kalebu jojuwe ndi jojwaakombula. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Ndienu, Loho waka Bambu Sapanga juhikila Otinieli ndi jwabia nhamusi jwa Aizilaeli. Ndienu jwajenda ku ngondu kukomana na Kushani Lishataimu bambu nkolongu juku Mesopotania, Bambu Sapanga anzangatiya kunhwesa. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ndienu bandu bupundema babiya nu lukwali kwa yaka alubaini mbaka Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi pajwakuwa.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Aizilaeli bakotuka kabee kunzetake Bambu Sapanga su kuhenga mahakau, Ndienu Bambu Sapanga anhenga Eguloni bambu nkolongu juku Mohabu ili jaawesa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Eguloni jwaakema pamu Ahamoni na Ahamaleki ajongana najombi, jwahika kukomana na Aizilaeli nabombi bugujukua musi wi mitendi, liina lengi la musi we hogu akemika Yeliku. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Aizilaeli buntumakiya bambu nkolongu Eguloni juku Moabu kwa yaka komi na nani.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Ndienu, Aizilaeli bunndelila kabee Bambu Sapanga, najombi jwaahagulia nkombosi, Ehudi mundu jojutumi kuboku kwa mangega, mwana waka Gela, mundu ju likabila la Benyamini. Aizilaeli buntuma Ehudi jupelika nhupi yabu kwaka Eguloni bambu nkolongu juku Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Henu Ehudi julilenganaki mpamba nkolongu gogutema koni na koni, ulasu waki wabia sendimita hamsini, jugukonga upanga we hogu nkati ji ingobu yaki mu nhungu waki guupandi uku malele. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Ankabisa nhupi Eguloni bambu nkolongu juku Moabu jojuwe jwabia nneni ngamaa. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi ejabiya jukabisi nhupi yela, jaapwagila bandu bababia atotwi nhupi yela jwaapwagila abokaninya. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Lakini jombi jalongana na bombi mbaka pi imong'umong'u ya malibu yebabia abasiki pambipi na Giligali, ankelabukia Eguloni nukupwaga, “Bambu nkolongo mii na malobi gaku ga sili.” Najombi bambu nkolongu jaapwagila atumisi baki “Ntuleka kajika jitu.” Nabombi baaleka nukubokane. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ndi Ehudi anhegalia pajwabia jutemi kajika jaki mu sumba sukunani sa nyumba jaki ju ubambu sekijingisa nhwai sejutumii palumu nukupwaga, “Mii na malobi gaku kuhuma kwaka Sapanga.” Bambu hejwabia jujumuka pikiteu saki, <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi jwanyosha kuboku kwaki kwa mangega nukuguholomoo upanga gojwabia juukongiki mu nhungu waki uku malele nukuntonga mu lutumbu lwaka bambu nkolongu Eguloni kwa makili. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Mbaka mpini wajingala mu lutumbu pamu nu upanga wene, nu mpamba nkolongu we wapitila mu nngongu waki. Ehudi ngasejwahopwi upanga wehogo, <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Ehudi jwapita kunza pabalasa nukunzigali milyangu ya sumba sukunani kwa punguu. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi ejabiya juboi, atumisi bahika nukuketane milyangu ya sumba sukunani ajigi kwa punguu. Bapwaga, “Pengi kwaa jupiti kukelo mu sumba saki sukunani.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Balendalia ngamaa mbaka batumbuliya kuhola, ndaba jwabia ngasejuhogo bajukua pungu nukuhogo. Ndi bumbona bambu nkolongu wabu jugoni pai koni juwii.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Pababia bakona aendale kulendale, Ehudi jwatenda kutila nukujenda mbaka kwi imong'umong'u ya malibu nu kutili ku Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Pajwahika kola jwajemba imbata mu nndema yiitombi yuku Efulaimu, nabombi Aizilaeli bahuluka pamu najombi kuhuma mu itombi koni jombi jutenda kwaalongule. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Jwaalagalakia, “Mmbwata nepani ndaba Bambu Sapanga junzangati kwaawesa Amoabu abaja binu.” Henu bahelala nukumpwata mbaka pandu pukulomboka puku Yoludani nu kwaanyaga Amohabu, nukupengale mundu jokapi jwiipeta. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Muda wehogu baakoma Amohabu akanalomi elupu komi babube boti babia baabii na makili na banga kujogopa nga hata jumu jojabiya jutiliki. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Lisoba leheli Aizilaeli baawesa Amoabu nu nndema wabia nu lukwali kwa yaka semanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamugali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Baada jaka Ehudi jwahika Shamugali mwana waka Anati, jwaalapula Afilisiti mia sita kwa ndonga jejionguliwe jukulongulake ng'ombi. Najombi jwaaokula Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Baada jaka Ehudi kuwa, Aizilaeli bahenga kabee kihakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga anzangatiya bambu nkolongu Jabini juku Kanani jaawesa jojwabia julongosa ku Hazoli. Nkolongu jwaakomana ngondu baki jwabia Sisela, jojwabia jutama ku Halosheti Hagoyimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Ndaba Jabini jwabia na magali mia tisa ga ngondu gukuhutwa na falasi, najombi jwabia jwaang'alisi Aizilaeli ku ukatili kwa yaka ishilini. Ndienu Aizilaeli bunndelila Bambu Sapanga jwaajangati.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Kipindi sehesi Debola nndota mmbomba nhwanu waka Lapidoti, ndi jojwabia jojutemu ku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola jwabia jujenda kutama pai ju nkongu guntendi gowabii pikilanda ja musi uku Lama nuku Beseli mu nndema wi tutombi yuku Efulaimu. Nabombi Aizilaeli bahika kwaki ili jwaatemulia. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Lisoba limu Debola jwaatuma bunkema Balaki mwana waka Abinoamu kuhuma ku Kedeshi ku ndema uku Nafutali kola nu kumpwagi, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Izilaeli jugulagalaki, ‘Jenda ukajukua akanalomi elupu komi kuhuma ku Nafutali nuku Zabuloni nzenda ku kitombi suku Taboli. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Nankolua Sisela nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu baka Yabini pamu na magali gaki ga ngondu na akomana ngondu baki ahika mbaka kulosi lwa Kishoni ili akomana na wehapa, nanepani nagujangati kunhwesa.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaki ampwagila, “Anagupiti pamu nanepani mbakanyendi, lakini ana ngagujendi pamu nanepani, nanepani nganyende.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola ampwagila, “Sakaka mbakanyendi pamu na wehapa, lakini ngawipati isima yokapi yukuwesa ndaba Bambu Sapanga anzangatiya mmbomba anhwesa Sisela.” Ndi Debola jwajenda pamu na Balaki mbaka ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaki jwaakema akomana ngondu ba makabila gaka Nafutali na Zebuluni ku Kadeshi, bandu elupu komi batenda kumpwata. Debola jwajenda pamu najombi.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Kipindi hesi Hebeli, mundu ju lukolu lwa Akeni jaaleka Akeni ajaki nu kutama kutalinabombi. Akeni babia kibeleku saka Hobabu nndamu waka Musa. Hebeli jasenga lihema laki pambipi nu nkongu nkolongu gobugukema Nhaloni gogubii ku Zaananimu pambipi nuku Kadeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Bandu bumpwagila Sisela kubanga Balaki mwana waka Abinoamu jukwei kitombi suku Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela jwajukua magali gaki goa mia tisa gikisomasoma guhutwa na falasina bandu boha bababia pamu najombi, kutumbuli Halosheti Hagoyimu mbaka ku losi luku Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Ndipala Debola ampwagila Balaki, “Jenda! Lende ndi lisoba lelule Bambu Sapanga juguhengiki gunhwesa Sisela. Boo! Bambu Sapanga ngasejugulonguli palongi jako?” Ndi Balaka jwahuluka kuhuma kukitombi suku Taboli koni bunzengale akomana ngondu elupu komi. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Kipindi Balaki paantukaliya Sisela ndienu Bambu Sapanga anhenga Sisela jubiya nu lujogopu na akomana ngondu baki boti palongi jaka Balaki ku upanga. Sisela jwaboka koni jubii na akomana ngondu baki nukutila kwa magolu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Lakini Balaki jwaabenga akomana ngondu bala kwa magali mbaka ku Halosheti Hagoyimu na kwaakoma akomana ngondu boti baka Sisela ku upanga wala ngasejwabii hata nkomana ngondu hata jumu jojwahigali.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Lakini Sisela jwatila kwa magolu mbaka ku lihema laka Yaeli nhwanu waka Hebeli, mundu ju lukolu lwa Keni. Jahenga hela kwa ndaba kwabia nu ukosi kati jaka Yabini bambu nkolongu juku Hazoni nu lukolu lwaka Hebeli mundu juku Keni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli jajenda kumpengana Siseli nukumpwagi, “Kalibu nkolongu wangu wala wiijogopa.” Ndi Sisela jwajingala mu lihema laka Yaeli najombi anhyekalia libulangeti lelikendiki. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Ampwagila, “Mii na nywiita gupepa na gumbekia masi gakunywa.” Ampekiya masiba badala ja masi nu kunhyekale kabee. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Ndienu Sisela ampwagila, “Jema mundyangu u lihema. Ana mundu jokapi juhikiki kunaluki, ‘Boo jubii mundu jokapi pambane?’ Wanzibua, ngasejubile.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />“Sisela jabiya jusokiki koni jugosi lugonu, ndienu Yaeli nhwanu waka Hebeli, jwajukua kipanda si lihema, nukujuku nyondu mu kuboku kwaki nu kunhepe mbolimboli pajabiya jugoni. Jukipotalia kikongu sesela pamiu jaki sajingala mbaka puluombi najombi jwatenda kuwa. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Balaki pajabiya jutenda kupwatali Sisela, Yaeli jwapita kunza kumpengana. Ampwagila, hika nugulangia mundu jountaputa.” Ndi bajingala nkati jilihema koni alongini, na ammbona Sisela jugoni homu koni juwii ni kipanda si lihema sabia ampoti pamiu jaki.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Ndienu lisoba lela Sapanga jajangatiya Aizilaeli kunhwesa Yabini, bambu nkolongu juku Kaanani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Nu kutumbuli kipindi hesi Aizilaeli baendalia kuba na makili kupete Yabini bambu nkolongu juku Kaanani mbaka pabunkoma.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Nhambu waka Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Ndienu Debola na Balaki mwana waka Abinoamu bajemba nhwambu gongo lisoba heli,<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Akakilongosi buku Izilaeli baalongua bandu babu kujenda kukomana ku ngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">bandu biliboa sukupala beni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">munsengula Bambu Sapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Mwakabambu akolongu nzoania!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Mwaka akolongu nzowanakiya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nanzembila Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">ku miambu nanzembila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Mwaa Bambu Sapanga pawahuma ku nndema uku Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">pawahelala mu migonda juku Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">nndema watenda kubagaja nu kunani kwatenda kwakuna iyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ena maundi gajitala masi.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Itombi yabagaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">hata kitombi suku Sinai sela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">palongi jaku Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">Sapanga juku Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mu masoba gajwabii Shamugali mwana waka Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">na masoba gaka Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">indela ngolongu ngasebapeta bandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">bandu bapeta mwi indela yu mwioli.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Bandu baalema ngasebabi, mu nndema uku Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mbaka panapitila nepani Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">nenabii ngati amabu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Aizilaeli bahagula kuilumbali isapanga yengi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">ndi kwapitila ngondu mu nndema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Lakini ngasejabonakini mundu hata jumu jojubii na ngau wala nkoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">kati ja akomana ngondu elupu alubaini buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Naapeke isima akolongu buku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">babilipia kwamoju ukupla beni pikilanda ja bandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">munsengula Bambu Sapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />“Mwaabandu ndandila majambu mwenkwela maponda mahuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwabandu mwentami matandiku gabei ngolongu mu maponda haga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nndandila lijambu hele mwanganya mwenzenda mwi indela kwamagolu.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Mwaajoanianya baajemba miambu baabi ku iliba ya masi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">ajemba kulandi mahengu makolongu gajahengiki Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Alandi namuna Aizilaeli hebaawesiki abaja babu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Ndienu bandu baka Bambu Sapanga bajenda mu matanga ga musi.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Jumuka, jumuka Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Jumuka! Jumuka gujemba nhambu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Jumuka, Balaki mwana waka Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">waajukua bandu baku bawaakamwi kwamakili kungondu.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Bandu baahobaleka bahelela kwaaka aka kilongosi babu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">bandu baka Bambu Sapanga bakelabuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">ili kukomana na abaja babu.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Bahika bandu kuhuma ku Efulaimu, babube kibeleku sa Aamaleki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">bajengaliya alongu babu Abenjamini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Kuhuma ku Makili bahuluka akakilongosi baakomana ngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">na kuhuma ku Zebuloni bahika akakilongosi akolongu.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Akolongu baka Isakali babia pamu na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">bandu baka Isakali jwabia pamu na Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">baampwata imbelu mbaka kuligomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Lakini likabila laka Leobeni latenda kubaganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">mioju jabu jabii nu kulilalukilaluki.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Boo, ndaba jakii bahigalii munyuma mwisisi ya makondoo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Boo, kujowane lee sauti ja pelembe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Lakini likabila laka Lubeni latenda kubaganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">mioju jabu jabii nu kulilalukilaluki.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Bandu bi likabila la Gileadi latama kwii ja Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Boo, ndaba jakii mwabandu bi likabila la Dani nhigali mu meli jino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Bandu bi likabila la Asheli lahigalia ku kumbwani ju nhanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Batemi pajijema meli.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Bandu bi likabila la Zebuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">babi tayali kuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Hata bandu bi likabila la Nafutali nabombi babia tayali hata kuwa mututombi twa matui.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Ku Taanaki pambipi na kalosi kuku Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">akabambu akolongu bahika nukukomana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">akabambu buku Kaanani batenda kukomana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">lakini ngasebajukwi madini ga feza.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Yabia ngati ndondu kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga yajangatia kukomana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">yapwata indela yabu, nukomana na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Kikoka sa masi ga losi uku Kishoni saajolalia na kwaaleke kutali, losi lwa pamwandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">ena kikoka kikali sa losi Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Nepani, niendalia kujenda kulongi kwa makili!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Falasi yaka Sisela yatila koni ipaga ya falasi yeibii na makili yatenda kutung'unda pai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">yatung'unda kwa makili payabiya itenda kutila.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Ntumi jukunani jwaka Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">‘Mugulapila yaambamba musi uku Melosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">mwaalapila yaambamba bandu baki su ukali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">ndaba ngasebaika kunzangati Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">ngasebunzangati Bambu Sapanga kupete baabi na makili haba’.<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yaeli jupata isima kupeta akambomba boti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Yaeli nhwanu waka Hebeli, mundu juku Keni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Ena jupengiwi kupeta akambomba boti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">baatama mu mahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela anndoba masi najombi ampekia masiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">anndetila masiba gagakendiki mu libakuli li isima.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Ku kuboku kumu jwakamula kikongu si lihema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">nuku kuboku kwaki kwa malele nyondu jaka pundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ankomangaliya Sisela kimutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">antunula pamiu jaki.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela jwajinama, nukuabuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">jwagonila nuu mu magolu gaka Yaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Mumagolu gaki jatenda kuhabuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">ndi jaabuka pai nakuwa!<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Amabaka Sisela balingalia mu lindilisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">balingalia nukulela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Ndaba jakii, ligali laki litei kuselewa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Mbona kulundami kwi ligali laki kuseliwi kujowaneka?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Lijibu julipata kwaaka mbomba baabi ni isima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">Jakelabukiya kulipwagi malobi haga.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Boo, ataputa lee hindu yeenyagiki nu kubagana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mmbomba jumu au abeli kwa kila mundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ingobu jealenganaki kwa mangoma gi makondoo ga langi ndaba jaka Sisela kuba hindu yukunyaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Ingobu ja sufu jealembiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ni mikupu mibeli jejinyambiki jukuwata hingu jangu!’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Mwaa Bambu Sapanga abaja baku boti akuwaje!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Lakini akosi baku abia ngati lioba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">palipita kwa mwanga waki!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Nagombi nndema wabia nu lukwali kwa yaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Aizilaeli bahenga kabee kihakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, najombi Bambu Sapanga jwaawesisa Amidiani jwaawesa kwi kipindi sa yaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Amidiani baang'alisa ngamaa Aizilaeli, mbaka Aizilaeli bilihembila mabomba na makolu ku itombi kuba pandu pukujoba pabu. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Kila mala Aizileli pabapanda imbeju mu migonda, Amidiani, Ahamaleki na bandu bangi buku mashaliki bahika kwaatukali. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Akalonda bi milema heji babekiki kambi munndema hogu nu kuhalabana ilebi yoti punndema mbaka pumpaka uku Gaza sanga kwaaleke Aizilaeli sindu sokapi, likubi likondoo, au ng'ombi au liponda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Kwa ndaba bahika na mipugu jabu na mahema gabu gabiya gingi ngati makundu ga halwa. Kwabiya ngakuwesikana kwaabalanga bandu na ngamia yabu bababia bugutukali nndema nukuguhalabana. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Amidiani bahenga Aizilaeli abiya akakapuku na banga na makili ndienu bunndelila Bambu Sapanga jwaajangatia.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Aizilaeli pabunndelila Bambu Sapanga jwaabokia mang'aliku gabapata kuhuma kwa Amidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Bambu Sapanga jwaapelakia nndota waka Sapanga najombi jwaapwagila, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jupwaga ana, ‘Numpia ku nndema uku Misili komwabii mwaatumwa, <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />nunkombula kuhuma pai ju ulongosi wa Amisili boti bababia anng'alisa mwanganya. Naabenga bandu palongi jii nukumpeke mwanganya nndema wabu. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ndi nunkombusa kubanga nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, na mwailumbali isapanga ya Ahamoli babube nndema wabu ntei kugujuku, lakini ngasemwajoani sauti jango.’”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga jwajenda nukutama pai ju nkongu nkolongu gobukema nhaloni guka Yoashi gogubii pambipi nuku Ofula, mundu ju lukolu lwa Abiezeli. Kipindi sehesi Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi jwabia jupeta inganu nkati ji libomba pandu paaminyi zabibu ili Amidiani baammbona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga ampitila Gidioni nukumpwagi, “Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu na wehapa, we gubii na makili na wanga kujogopa.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidioni ampwagila, “Waa Bambu wangu ana Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu na twepani ndaba jaki majambu goti gani gatei kutupata? Gabii kwaa mahengu gaki makolongu gabutulandila akahoku bito koni bakapwaga, ‘Bambu Sapanga ndi jojutupia ku nndema uku Misili.’ Lakini henu Bambu Sapanga jaaleka Amidiani butung'alisa!”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ang'anambukia nukumpwagi, “Jenda ku uwesu gogubii naku wakaagombula Aizilaeli kuhuma kwa Amidiani. Boo, nga nepani lee ndi nenugutuma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidioni anzibua, “Pepa koku Bambu, niiwesa boo kujigombo Izilaele? Lukolu lwangu ndi ngaselubii nu uwesu na makili mu likabila laka Manase na namweti nu nsoku ngani mu kilongu situ!”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Nagujangatiya wehapa na wehapa waakoma Amidiani ngati gunkoma mundu jumu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidioni ampwagila, “Nala ana gutei kunhagu nangia nginyuli ili manya wehapa ndi wegulongi nanepani. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nuguloba wiiboka pamba mbaka paniikelabuka nu kugulete nhupi yangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Bambu Sapanga jwajibua, “Niitama pamba mbaka pawiikelabuka.” <verse eid="JDG 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidioni jwajenda kunyumba jaki, nukuanda kambui na mabumunda ganga kujege amila kuhuma mu lidebi lu uwembi, jwajegala inyama mu kitonga ni imitu mu kibega, ndi jwapelika pai ju nkongu gu nhaloni nukumpeke. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Ntumi jukunani jwaka Sapanga ampwagila, “Jukua inyama na mabumunda ganga kujege amila uibeka panani ji lilibu lende. Ndi gujegala imitu panani ja mabumunda ni inyama, najombi jwahenga ahelahela. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Ntumi jukunani kwaka Sapanga jwanyosha ndonga jaki nukugusa inyama na mabumunda kwa ndonga apalapa mwotu wapitila mu lilibu watinia inyama na mabumunda. Ndi ntumi jukunani kwaka Sapanga jahoba palongi jaki.”<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Ndienu Gidioni jwamanya hoju jwabia ntumi jukunani jwaka Sapanga, jajamaliya kwa sauti, “Mitinikiboni nepani mwa Bambu Sapanga ndaba numbweni ntumi waku jukunani miu kwa miu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Gubia pe nu lukwali wiijogopa nga wiikuwe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidioni ansengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiiki matambiku nu kupakema, “Bambu Sapanga ndi Lukwali lwangu.” Pandu pukupiiki matambiku haga ku Ofula, musi ulukolu lwaka Abiezeli mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Ikilu heji Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Gidioni, “Jukua likambaku la ng'ombi limu la atati baku ni likambaku la pili lelibii na yaka saba. Bombula pandu pukupiiki matambiku gaka Baali ga atati baku nu kutunu kimong'umong'u sa Ashela sekibii pambipi naku. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Ndienu gunsengila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku sindu sasapi sukupiiki matambiku panani ja katombi kanga ngati ekupalika kusenga. Ndi gumbiikia litambiku lukutini ji likambaku la ng'ombi la pili sukutumi nhanzu yi kimong'umong'u sa Ashela segukitunwi.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Ndienu Gidioni jwaajukua atumisi baki komi, jwahenga ngati he jwalagalakia Bambu Sapanga. Lakini ndaba jwaajogopa alongu baki na bandu ba pamusi badala jukuhenga haga pamuhi, jwahenga ikilu.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Bandu ba musi pabajumuka pulukela babona pandu pukupiiki matambiku ga Baali ni imong'umong'u sa Ashela sesabii pambipi atunwi pamu na ngombi ja pili jebatini panani ja mesa inyai jukupiiki matambiku jejwabia jusengiki pandu pala. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Balaluana, “Boo, nya jojuhengiki lijambu heli?” Pabaendaliya kulaluana nukutaputa nakanopi bamanya kubanga Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi ndi jojuhengiki lihengu heli. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Bandu bunzendila Yoashi, bumpwagila, “Mpia mwana waku tunkoma, ndaba juhalabini pandu pukupiiki matambiku ja Baali nu kutunu kimong'umong'u sa Ashela jejabi pambipi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Lakini Yoashi jwaapwagila boti bababia atenda kumpenga, “Boo munkengale Baali? Boo mwitenda kunkombola? Jokapi jo jwankengalia Baali jwiikomika kabula jukukusa. Ana Baali ndi Sapanga ndi julikengalia mweni, ndaba pandu paki pukumpiiki matambiku atei kupabombola.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Lisoba heli bunkema Gidioni, “Yelubaali.” Lihina Baali mana jaki ndi julikengalia mweni, ndaba Gidioni japabombula pandu pukupiiki matambiku gaka sapanga Baali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Kipindi sehesi Amidiani na Ahamaleki na bandu boti baatama pulutengu ju upandi golipiti lyoba batenda kujetanganela kukomana pamu. Balombuka losi luku Yoludani nukubeka kambi yabu pi ligomba la Yezileeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Lakini Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga junhikila Gidioni. Gidioni jwajemba imbata kwaakema bandu bu lukolu lwaka Abiezeli ahika kumpwata. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Jwaatuma bandu mu nndema woti uku Manase ahika kumpwata. Bandu bangi jwaatuma kwaakema bandu ba makabila guku Asheli na Zebuloni na Nafutali nabombi bahika kujongana najombi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Ndienu Gidioni ampwagila Sapanga, “Ana sakaka winhenga nepani naakombola Aizilaeli ngati hewapwaga, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />henu meka ngosi ji likondoo pai paapete inganu pamba. Ana kwiibia nu ulumi panani ja ngosi pena na pai papijiyongolota ngosi ana piibia pajomu nala niimanya gutei kundumi kwaakombo Aizilaeli ngati hegupwagiki.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Kwabi ahelahela, ndaba pajwajumuka kilabu jaki pulukela jwaminya masi gagaabia panani ja ngosi jela nu kutwelake bakuli. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidioni ampwagila Sapanga, “Pepakoku wiinhyome. Nuguloba nongila mala jimu kabee. Nuguloba gunekakia ndumia ngosi jenze kulenge sindu sengi. Lakini henu nuguloba panani jangosi jenze pabia pajomu, lakini pai pabia nu ulumi.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Sapanga jwahenga ahelahela ikilu jela, ndaba panani ja ngosi kwabia kujomu na pai pabia nu ulumi.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni jwaawesa Amidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Yelubaali yaani Gidioni na akomana ngondu boti bababia pamu najombi bajumuka pulukela babeka kambi jabu kumosu pambipi ni kiliba saka Helodi, kambi ja Amidiani jabia upandi wa kasikazini ji ligomba pambipi ni katombi sa Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Gidioni, “Akomana ngondu bagubii nabu ndi bingi ngamaa kwangu kwaahenga baawesa Amidiani. Ili Aizilaeli bakipuna palongi jangu nu kupwaga atei kulioko beni. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Henu waapwagila akomana ngondu boti kubanga mundu jokapi jojujogopa au jojubagaja juboka pikitombi sa Gileadi nu jubuja kunyumba jaki.” Ndienu Gidioni jwaalenga, na bandu elupu ishilini ni ibeli babuja kunyumba jwaigalia na bandu elupu komi pena.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Gidioni, “Akomana ngondu haba akona bingi ngamaa. Henu waapelika kulosi nane niitenda kwaalenga kokoko. Mundu jokapi jonagupwagila, ‘Hajo jwiijenda pamu na wehapa jombi jiitenda kujenda. Lakini ana mbwagiki hajo ngajujendi pamu na wehapa, ngajiijendi na wehapa.’”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Ndienu Gidioni jwaapelika bandu kulosi na Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Bandu babiilamba masi ngati jimbwa, waabeka kutali na bandu babiipega magoti kunywa masi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Akomana ngondu babakunywa masi sukuteka kwa maboku gabu nu kulamba ngati jimbwa babia mia tatu. Lakini bangi boti babaigali bapega magoti kunywa masi.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Gidioni, “Kupete akomana ngondu mia tatu haba babakunywa masi kukulamba ngati jimbwa, naakombula Aizilaeli na kwaahenga baawesa Amidiani. Lakini bangi bala boti abuja mu manyumba gabu.”<verse eid="JDG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Ndienu Gidioni jwajukua posu ja bababia atenda kuboka ni imbata na kwaatabuka abuja. Najombi jwaigalia na akomana ngondu mia tatu bala. Kambi ja Amidiani jabia upandi wabu wa pai.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Ikilu jela Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Gidioni, “Boka gujenda mu makambi gabu, ndaba naguhenga waawesa. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Lakini ana gutenda kujogopa, gujenda pamu nu ntumisi waku Pula. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Hoku wiijowana gaapwaga, na wehapa wiipata makili gukuwesa kujenda kwaalapu.” Henu Gidioni jwajenda pamu nu ntumisi waki Pula mbaka paatama alonda ba zamu bi likambi la Amidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Akomana ngondu buku Midiani na Ahamaleki na akomana ngondu boa buku upandi golipiti lyoba bajagania kilapandu, babia bingi ngati halwa na ngamia yabu yanga kubalangika yabia ingi ngati nsangi ukumbwani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidioni pajwahika, anzowania mundu jumu ansimuli nzaki ndotu jaki ana, “Nalota ndotu. Nalota libumunda la shaili labilinguka mbaka ku likambi kwa Amidiani nu kulilapu lihema nuku lipendu pai kunani. Lihema lagoni pai.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Nzaki jwajibua, “Lijambu heli nga sindu sengi ila jilang goniogu upanga waka Nhizilaeli Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi jojuwe Bambu Sapanga anhengiki jaawesa Amidiani pamu na akomana ngondu baki boti.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidioni pajwajowana gaalandi kwi ndotu heji na maana angungamalia Sapanga. Ndi jwabuja ku likambi la Aizilaeli nu kupwaaga, “Nzumuka tubokaniaje ndaba Bambu Sapanga junnzangati mwaawesa alonda ba Amidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Ndi jwaabagula akomana ngondu mia tatu bala mu makundi matatu, jwaapekia imbata ni ibega yanga na masi yeibii na haha yeinyaka mwotu. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Jwaapwagila, “Nningalia na mwiihenga sapi ngati heniihenga panihika ku likambi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Paniipega imbata, nepani pamu ni likundi langu, mwaboha mwiipega imbata kuhuma kila upandi nukupwaga kwa sauti ngolongu, ‘Ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga na kwa ndaba jaka Gidioni.’”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Pakwahegalia pamahiku, Gidioni ni likundi laki la bandu mia jimu bahika pa mwisu wi likambi. Hogu wabia utumbuli wikipindi sa akomanangondu paabadilisana zamu yukulonda. Bapega imbata nu kukaju ibega yebabii naku. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Makundi goha matatu gapega imbata nu kukaju ibega yabu. Mumaboku gabu gu ku mangega bakamwi miengi na mu maboku gabu guku malele bakamwi imbata nu kujemba koni ajamali kwa sauti ngolongu, “Upanga kwa ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga na kwa ndaba jaka Gidioni!”<verse eid="JDG 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Bajema kila mundu pandu paki kujiyongolota kambi ja Amidiani. Alonda boti ba Amidiani batenda kupesangana koni bakapega keleli.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Akomana ngondu baka Gidioni pababia ajemba imbata yabu mia itatu, Bambu Sapanga jwaahenga Amidiani atumbulia kukomana beni kwa beni mu likambi. Babahigali sanga kuwa batenda kutilila ku Betishita kujenda ku Selela, mbaka ku mpaka wa Abeli Mehola pambipi na Tabati. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Gidioni jaakema akomana ngondu bangi buku Izilaeli kuhuma ku likabila la Nafutali na Asheli na Manase boti baakema na kwaapwata Amidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidioni jwaatuma bandu mu nndema wi itombi ya Efulaimu bakatangasa, “Nhelala kwaapenga Amidiani nu kukamula ilosi na losi wa Yoludani mbaka Beti Bala.” Ndi akomana ngondu boti buku Efulaimu bahika nukugukamu losi lwa Yoludani mbaka Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Baakamula aka kilongosi abeli buku Midiani, yaani Olebu na Zeebu. Bunkoma Olebu mu lilibu laka Olebu najombi Zeebu bunkoma pandu pukuminyi zabibu paka Zeebu pababia baapwatali Amidiani. Bunndetila Gidioni imutu saka Olebu na Zeebu kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni jaawesa Amidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Bandu bi likabila la Efulaimu bunndalukia Gidioni, “Ndaba jaki gutuhenge hela? Ndaba jaki ngaseutukemiki pa wajenda kukomana na Amidiane?” Bunndaumua su ukali.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Lakini Gidioni jwaajibwa, “Majambu ganhengiki nepani nga sindu ngati ganhengiki mwanganya. Kisoku seahengiki akomana ngondu binu buku Efulaimu ndi kikolongu peta setuhengiki twepani twaakomana ngondu bu lukolu lwa Abiezeli. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Sapanga junzangati mwanganya kwaawesa akolongu buku Midiani, Olebu na Zeebu. Boo nepani nhengiki kii kikolongu kupeta mwanganya?” Gidioni pajwajomula kupwaaga haga, inyela yabu kwaki yatenda kukotoka.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidioni na ajaki mia tatu bahika ku Yoludani, nukulomboka. Hata ngati babia asokiki ngamaa, baendalia kwaapwatalia aka abaja babu. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Ndienu ebahika ku musi uku Sukoti jaapwagila, “Mpepa koku mwaapekia ajangu haba mabumunda ndaba asokiki ngamaa, nanepani nakona nhendale kwaapwatali aka bambu akolongu buku Midiani Zeba na Salumuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Lakini aka kilongosi buku Sukoti bunndalukia, “Ndaba jaki twaapekia posu alonda baku koni ngasemwawesiki Zeba na Salumuna?.”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidioni jwapwaga, “Hena, lakini Bambu Sapanga pajinyangatiya kwaawesa Zeba na Salumuna, naijendulana nhyega jinu kwa mia yukulungweza na mia ya mbigili.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Kuhuma kola jwaajendila bandu buku Penueli, jwaaloba kwa namuna hajelajejela. Nabombi bandu ba musi uku Penueli bunzibua ngati hebunzibua bandu buku musi uku Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidioni jwaapwagila, “Paniikelubuka kulukwali niibombula nnala wii gongo.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Kipindi hesi Zeba na Salimuna babia ku Kalikoli pamu na akaalonda babu, bandu elupu komi nu nhwanu babube ndi babaigalia kuhuma kwa alonda bu upandi golipiti lyoba, ndaba alonda laki jimu ni ishilini babia baakomiki. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidioni jwapwata indela ja bandu baajenda sapwali jejibii upandi wakolipiiti lyoba uku Noba nuku Yogubeha, jwaalapula alonda bala babube ngasebijiandi kukomana. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Aka bambu abeli buku Midiani babube ndi Zeba na Salumuna batei kutila, lakini Gidioni jwaapwatalia na kwaakamu na kwaahenga alonda babu boha abia ni kiholu kikolongu.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Ndienu, Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi jakelubuka kuhuma kungondu jwapeta mu kikwelu suku Helesi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Ankamula nkombu jumu juku Sukoti nu kunndaluki mahina gaka kilongosi. Ndienu nkombu hoju anhandakia maina sabini gaka kilongosi baamanyakini nakanopi na aseja akolongu buku Sukoti, jumula bandu sabini na saba. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidioni jakelabuka kwa aka kilongosi buku musi uku Sukoti, nakwaapwagi, “Sinkomboka hemwandondula pamwapwaga, ‘Ndaba jaki twaapekia posu bandu baku baatondiki ngani nanamu mwakona ngasemunhwesiki Zeba na Salumuna?’ Henu nndinga Zeba na Salumuna ndi bamba.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Ndi jwaajukua akakilongosi ba musi hogu na kwaalapu kwa miha yukulungwenza na mbigili ili bandu buku Sukoti bilibola. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Kabee jwajenda ku musi uku Penueli nukugubombo nnala na kwaakoma bandu ba musi hogu.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Ndienu jwaalalukia Zeba na Salumuna, bandu bamwaakoma ku Taboli babia bandu bole? Bunzibua, “Balengana na wehapa ndaba babonikana ngati bana baka bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Najombi jwaapwagila, “Haba babia akaalongu bango, bana ba amabu bango bukumeleka. Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi ana mwakaalei bomi na nepani nukunndeka mwanganya mwabomi.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Ndienu ampwagila mwana waki jojatumbula kusaliwa jobunkema Yeteli, “Jenda wakaakoma.” Lakini Yeteli jwajogupa kuhopo upanga waki ndaba jwabia jwakona nkombu nsoku.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Ndienu Zeba na Salumuna bapwaga, “Tukoma wamwete, ndaba lenieli ndi lihengu laka mwanahota.” Gidioni jwaakoma mweni nukujuku mapambu gabu gagabia mu hingu ja ngamia yabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Ndipala Aizilaeli bumpwagila Gidioni, “Wehapa gubia ukilongosi witu na baada jaku wehapa jatulongusa mwana waku nu nsokoo waku ndaba wehapa gutugombwi kuhuma kwa Amidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidioni jwaajibwa “Nepani nganiikubi kilongosi winu wala mwana wangu nga jiikubi kilongosi wino. Ila Bambu Sapanga ndi jojwiibia kilongosi wii.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Ndienu jwaapwagila, “Mbala kumpwagi sindu simu, noba kila jumu wii jumbekia ndolosa ya zahabu yejunyagiki.” Amidiani bala ndaba babia ngati Aishimaeli na bandu bangi bayobali kuwata hindu ya zahabu. <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Bandu bunzibua, “Twakupekia sukukupala twabee.” Batandika ingobu na kila jumu jwalekala ndolosa ya zaabu yebabia biinyagiki ku ngondu. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Kutopa kwa hindu ya zaabu yoti yejapala bumpekia kwabia kilu ishilini. Hindu yengi yejwajopa yabia ndolosa ya madini ga feza ni ingobu ya zambalau yebawata aka bambu akolongu buku Midiani ni mikupu jejabia mu nhingu ja ngamia wabu. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidioni jwiitumia hindu hei kulenganake kimong'umong'u sesuse jukibeka mu musi waki uku Ofula. Aizilaeli boti bajenda kola kukilumbali. Kimong'umong'u hesi saika kuba ntaba kwaka Gidioni na ajaki. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Ndi Amidiani basindwa palongi ja Aizilaeli na ngasebabia bandu bukujogopwa kabee. Ndienu bandu buku Izilaeli babia nu lukwali kwa yaka alubaini kipindi Gidioni pajwabia mwomi.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidioni yaani Yelubaali mwana waka Yoashi jwabuja kunyumba jaki nu kutama hoku. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidioni jwabia na bana sabini akanalomi ndaba jwajukwii akambomba bingi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Jwabia ni libangu ku Shekemu lelumbelakia mwana mwanalomi, liina laki Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi jwakuwa koni jubii na yaka yingi ngamaa, buntaga mu litenge laka Yoashi atati baki mu musi uku Ofula wa Abiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Baada ja kuwa kwaka Gidioni Aizilaeli biikelabukia kabee isapanga Baali nu kuilumbali. Bunhenga Baali Beliti kuba sapanga wabu. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Aizilaeli bunzegwa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wabu, jojwaakombula kuhuma kwa abaja babu bingi babaayonguluta kila upandi. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Lakini ngasebahengi majambu gaamboni bana baka Yelubaali yaani Gidioni hatangati jahengi gaamboni Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki mwana waka Gidioni jwaajendila alongu na bana boti bu lukolu lwaka anyongo baki ku Shekemu na kwaapwagi, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Mbwagila apamba palongi ja bandu boti buku Shekemu, sindu boo saasapi kwinu, bana boti sabini akanalomi baka Yelubaali andongusa mwanganya au mwana jumo? Nkombuka nepani na mwanganya mwai gumo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Alongu ba anyongo baki baalandila malobi ganga bandu boti buku Shekemu, bunzetakia ndaba bapwaga, “Jombi nndongu wito.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Bumpeki ipandi sabini ya madini ga feza yeyabi mu nyumba ji kisapanga Baali Beliti yejuitumia kwaakodi bandu bana ngukuna na bandu banga kujogopa sindu sokapi ili bumpwata. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Abumeleki na bandu baki bajenda kunyumba ja atati baki ku Ofula na kola jwaakoma alongu baki boti sabini panani jililibu limu. Lakini Yotamu, mwana nsoku waka Gidioni jwatenda kulama ndaba jwatei kulihia. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Ndienu bandu boti buku Shekemu nuku Beti Milo bakusanyika ku mwaloni gogubii pambipi nu nnala ku Shekemu nukunhimika Abimeleki kuba bambu nkolongu wabu.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu pajwamanya majambu haga, jwajenda kujema panani ji kitombi Gelizimu nukupwaga kwa sauti ngalongu, “Nnyowania nepani mwabandu buku Shekemu ili Bambu Sapanga najombi janzowania mwanganya. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Lisoba limu mikongu jajenda kulitaputi bambu nkolongu. Ndi yumpwagila nkongu gu mzeituni, ‘Wehapa gubia wabambu nkolongu witu!’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Lakini nkongu gumzeituni gola wajibua, ‘Nkita nhwesa kulileka lihengu langu lukulenganake mahuta gaguge gapalika ngamaa ni isapanga na bandu, nyenda kulisumbua kulongosa mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Ndienu mikongu jijipwagila nkongu gu ntini, ‘Guhika wehapa gubia wabambu nkolongu witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Lakini nkongu gu ntini gola wajibua, ‘Boo, nhwasali nhwesa kukotoka lihengu la lukubeleka matunda, ga sapi na gaganoga, nyenda kulisumbuu kuba bambu nkolongu wimikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Ndi mikongu jijipwagila nkongu gu mzabibu, ‘Guhika wehapa gubia bambu nkolongu wito.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Lakini nkongu u mzabibu gwajibwa, ‘Nhwasali nhwesa kukotoka lihengu langu lukupia divai jejitogulesa isapanga na bandu nyenda kulisumbu kuba bambu nkolongu wi mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Mwisu we mikongu joa jugujendila nkongu wa miha nukugupwagi, ‘Guhika wehapa gubia wabambu nkolongu witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Nkongu wa mia wajibua, ‘Ana sakaka mpala kunhagu kuba bambu nkolongu wii nhika ntama pai ji kihilu sango. Lakini ana ngasempala kuhenga hela nala mwotu gupita kuhuma mu mia yangu nukutinia hata mikongu jebijikema mielezi juku Lebanoni.’”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu jwaendalia kupwaga, “Henu nholale munhengiki Abimeleki kuba bambu nkolongu kwa mawasu ga sapi nu kukuhobaleka? Boo, nhwasali munhengi gamboni Yelubaali na bandu baki ngati hekupalika kunhenge? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Nkombuka atati bangu ankomania mwanganya kulagi akuwi ili kunhoko mwanganya kuhuma kwa Amidiani! <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Lakini lelenu mwaalapwi alongu ba atati bangu na kwaakoma bana sabini panani jililibu limu, kabee munhengiki Abimeleki mwana waka ntumisi mmbamba jwa atati jubia bambu nkolongu wa bandu buku Shekemu ndaba pee ndi mundu ju lukolu lwii. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Henu ana nhengiki haga kukuhobaleka na kukuntende isima Yelubaali na alongu baki nala ntogulia pamu na Abimeleki najombi jutogulia pamu najombi. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Lakini ana ngahela, nala mwotu guhuma kwaka Abimeleki na kwaatini bandu buku Shekemu nuku Beti Milo, kabee mwotu guhuma kwa bandu buku Shekemu na Beti Milo guntinia Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Ndi Yotamu jwatenda kutila, jwatilila ku musi uku Beeli, jwatama kola ndaba annzogopa Abimeleki nndongu waki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki jwabia bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli kwa yaka mitatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Ndi Sapanga jwaleta loho ju ubaja kati jaka Abimeleki na bandu buku Shekemu, nabombi bandu buku Shekemu batenda ku nng'anambuka. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Hela ndi hebaalapula bandu buku Shekemu pamu nu nndongu wabu Abimeleki ndaba ju ubaja gobaahengila bana sabini baka Yelubaali. Kwaakoma hoku kwaapata ndaba Abimeleki jwaakoma koni jujangatiwa na bandu buku Shekemu haba. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Bandu buku Shekemu baabeka bandu bukunhepale Abimeleki mututombi. Bandu haba baanyaga mali gabu boti babapeta kola. Na Abimeleki bumpwagi majambu gegala.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Lisoba limu Gahali mwana waka Ebeli, pamu na alongu baki bajenda kutama ku Shekemu. Bandu buku Shekemu batumbulia kunhobale Gahali. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Baboka nukujenda ku matui gabu gi mizabibu, bajukua zabibu nukuiminya, balenganakia divai nukuhenga tipati. Bajingala mu nyumba jaka kisapanga sabu bakula na kunywa nu kuntondo Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gahali mwana waka Ebeli jwapwaaga, Abimeleki ndi nyane? Twepani pa Shekemu pani tubitwabandu ba namuna bole mbaka tuntumakia Abimeleke? Boo jombi le nga mwana waka Yelu Bahale na Zebuli le nga joanzangatiaje? Mwaatumakia banabaka Hamoli atati baka Shekemu. Ndaba jaki twepani tuntumakia Abimeleke? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Ana bandu haba bakabi mu ulongosi wangu, nakabia nummboiki Abimeleki. Nukumpwagila Abimeleki, jonzukia akomana ngondu baku ndi guhika tukomana paabi bandu na mbaka nuguwese.<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli kilogosi wa musi pajwajowana malobi gaka Gaali mwana waka Ebedi, jwayomiki ngamaa. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Ndienu jwaatuma bandu kwa sili kwaka Abimeleki ku Toluma kumpwagi, “Gahali mwana waka Abedi pamu na alongu baki abi pamusi uku Shekemu pani na baakolo bandu bugung'anambuka wehapa. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Henu, ikilu gubuja wehapa na bandu bagubinaku mukunhepila mu matui pambipi na musi. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Lioba paliipita pulukela, waatukalia bandu ba pamusi. Gahali ana jupitiki pamu na bandu baki kuhika kugulapu, waahengila ngati henhwesa kwahenge.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki jwaboka ikilu pamu na bandu bajwabi naku kuhika ku Shekemu. Jwaabaga bandu baki makundi nsesi nu kunhepe pambipi na musi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Gahali mwana waka Ebeli jwapita kunza nu kujema pi litanga la musi kipindi sehesi Abimeleki na bandu baki bapitalia pandu pababia ajobiki. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gahali paambona ampwagila Zebuli, “Linga bandu ahuluka kuhuma mu itombi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebuli ampwagila, “Wehapa gubona ihilu yi itombi ngati bandu baajenda.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gahali jwapwaga kabee, “Bandu ahuluka pikilanda ju nndema na bandu bangi ahuma upandi gu nkongu Nhaloni wa Baalondo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Ndienu Zebuli ampwagila, “Kukipuna kwaku kubii kwaa henu? Nga wehapa wewapwaga, ‘Abimeleki ndi nyane? Ndaba jaki tuntumakiaje?’ Henu haba ndi bandu bawaapoiki lihamu gujenda waka komana naku.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gahali jwaboka na kwaalongosa bandu buku Shekemu nukukomana na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Gahali jwasindwa nukutila, koni Abimeleki jutenda kwaapwata. Bandu bingi batenda kukomeka mu litanga la musi. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki jwatama ku Aluma na Zebuli ambenga Gahali na alongu baki kuhuma ku musi uku Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Lisoba lelapwata, Abimeleki bumpwagila kubanga bandu buku Shekemu apitiki kumusi nu kujenda mu matui. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Jwaajukua akomana ngondu baki na kwaabeka mu makundi nsesi ili ajenda kuhepale mu matui. Pajwaabona bandu apita ku musi jwapita kojwabia juliiki na kwaakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki ni likundi laki limu bajenda imbelu kujenda kulenda nndiyangu uku musi. Makundi gaki gangi mabeli gaalapula bandu bababia ku matui bala na kwaakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki jwakomana na bandu ba musi hogu lisoba loka. Juunyaga musi na kwaakoma bandu boha bababia mola. Juguutinia musi kwa mwotu nu kugumisangana mwinyu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Bandu boha bababia pu nnala uku Shekemu pabamanya haga batilila mulibomba la nyumba jaka kisapanga sebikikema Eli Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki bumpwagila kubanga bandu boti bababi ku nnala uku Shekemu, bilibongini pamu. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki na bandu baki bajenda ku kitombi suku Salumoni, jwajukua lipengu jwasekula limbandi lunkongu nu kulibeka mu libega laki. Ndi jwaapwagila bandu bababia pamu na jombi ahenga nyatanyata ngati hejuhengiki jombi. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kila jumu jwasekula limbandi ngati laka Abimeleki. Bajukua mambandi gabu na kugabeka panani jilibomba bagapambakia mwotu, bandu boti akanalomi na akambomba babia elupu jimu bababia aumiki kunnala uku Shekemu batenda kuwa.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Ndienu Abimeleki na alonda baki jwajenda ku Tebesi juguyonguluta musi nu kugukamu. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Lakini kwabia nu nnala gogubii nganganganga pikilanda ja musi. Ndi bandu boti ba musi hogu akambomba na aka nalomi batilila kola nu kulijigalia nkati. Bakwela mu nhwagaa unnala hogu. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki juguikila nnala nukugulapu, juguhegalia nndyangu gu nnala ili jugujosa mwotu. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Nu mmbomba jumu jalekala lilibu lukunani luku yagi, nu kumponda Abimeleki kimutu saki. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Ndi Abimeleki ankema nyata nkombu waki joantotulia hindu yukukomane ampwagila, “Jukua upanga waku gungoma, biika bandu kupwaga jwangoma mmbomba.” Nkombu jola jwajukua upanga waki nu kunkoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Aizilaeli pababona Abimeleki jukuwiki, baboka nu kubuja kila jumu kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Hela ndi Sapanga heampekia azabu Abimeleki kupete likosa le jwaahengila atati baki kwa kwaakoma alongu baki sabini. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Ahelahe Sapanga jwaahenga bandu buku Shekemu apata azabu ndaba ju ubaja wabu gobahengiki. Ndienu yaambamba yaka Yotamu mwana waka Yelubaali yatenda kwaapata.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Baada ja kuwa kwaka Abimaleki, Tola mwana waka Pua nsokoo waka Dodo juku likabila laka Isakali, jwapitila kwaakombo Aizilaeli. Tola jwatama ku musi uku Shamili mu nndema ji itombi yuku Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Jwabia mundu kilongosi jukuamuli jwa Aizilaeli kwa yaka ishilini na tatu ndi jwatenda kuwa nu kutagwa ku Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Baada jaka Tola jwapitila Yaili juku Gileadi, nakuba kilongosi jukuamuli jwa Aizilaeli kwa yaka ishilini ni mibeli. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili jwabia na bana banalomi selasini bababia ajende maponda selasini na bababia misi selasini ku nndema uku Gileadi, jejuje mbaka lelenu bijikema Hawoti Yaili yaani misi selasini yaka Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili jwatenda kuwa nu kutagwa ku Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Aizilaeli bahenga kabee uhakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga nu kutumaki Mabaali, Maashitaloti ni isapanga yuku Shamu jebijikema Silia nu yuku Sidoni na yuku Moabu na yuku Amoni na ya Afilisiti. Bunndeka Bambu Sapanga na wala ngase bunndumbalia kabee. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Inyela jaka Bambu Sapanga yaahikila Aizilaeli, najombi jaanhenga Afilisiti na Ahamoni jaawesa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Kwa yaka komi na nani haba baang'alisa na kwaabone Aizilaeli babatama ku Gileadi ku lieneu la Ahamoli upandi golipititi lyoba wa losi Yoludani munndema uku Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Ahamoni nabombi balobuka losi Yoludani kukomana na makabila guku Yuda na Benjamini na Efulaimu. Nabombi Aizilaeli bapata mang'aliku ngamaa.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Ndi Aizilaeli bunndelila Bambu Sapanga koni bakapwaga, “Tuguhengi mahakau ndaba tugulekiki wehapa wa Bambu Sapanga witu nukutumaki Mabaali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga jwaapwagila, “Boo, nengasenukombula kuhuma kwa Amisili na Aamoni na Ahamoli na Afilisiti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Boo, nengasenukombula kuhuma kwa Asidoni na Aamaleki na Amidiani? Bandu haba bunng'alisa na mwanganya mwanelila nepani na nepani nunkombula pai ju ulongosi wabu. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Hata hela mwanganya ntei kuneka, nukutumaki isapanga yenge. Henu nga nunkombo kabete. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Nzendania mwikiilelila isapanga yemuihagwi. Muileka heyi yunkombula mu mang'aliku gino!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Lakini Aizilaeli bumpwagila Bambu Sapanga, “Tuhengiki mahakau. Gutuhenga ngati hegupala, lakini tuguloba gutuhokula leleno.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ndi biilekala kutali isapanga ikigeni, nukuntumaki kabee Bambu Sapanga. Bambu Sapanga ngasejwawesa kuendale kuhinakali pajwabona mang'aliku ga Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Ahamoni bakusanyika pamu nukubeka kambi jabu ku Gileadi. Aizilaeli nabombi bakusanyika pamu nukubeka kambi jabu ku Mizipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Aizilaeli na aka kilongosi babu balalukania, “Nya jojwiitumbulia kukomana na Ahamoni? Jojwiihenga hela ndi jojwiibia kilongosi jwa bandu boti buku Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Ku Gileadi kwabii na nkomana ngondu jwana makili jobunkema Yefuta, mwana waka nyongo jumu jojutenda ugoni, atati baki bunkemika Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gileadi jwabia kabee na bana bangi kuku nhanu waki. Bana baka mmbomba hoju pababia akolongu bummbenga Yefuta kuhuma kunyumba, bumpwagila, “Wehapa ngasegubii na haki jukupata ulisi kuhuma kwa atati bitu ndaba wehapa wamwana ukumbomba jongi.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Ndi Yefuta jwaatila alongu baki nukujenda kutama ku nndema uku Tobu. Hoku bandu biliya bajongana najombi, bumpwata mu sapwali jaki.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Mwenikatai, bandu bi likabila la Ahamoni baalapula Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Pakwapitila hela, aseja buku Gileadi bajenda kunndeta Yefuta kuhuma ku nndema uku Tobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />bumpwagila, “Ika gutulongua mu ngondu jitu na Ahamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Lakini Yefuta jwaapwagila aseja buku Geliadi, “Boo, nga mwanganya le mo mwanzukila mbaka mwamenga kunyumba ja atati bango? Ndaba jaki nhiki sajenu koni mbii mu mang'aliko?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Aseja buku Gileadi bala bumpwagila, “Hena tugusukile lakini heno tugupwatiki ili gujenda natwepani kukomana na Ahamoni, na wehapa wiibia kilongosi witu na jwa bandu boti buki Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta jwaapwagila aseja baka Gileadi, “Ana nngelabwi kunyumba nakakomana na Ahamoni na Bambu Sapanga junyangati kwaawesa, boo, mwijetakia lee nepani mia kilongosi wino?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Aseja buku Gileadi bala bumpwagila Yefuta, “Bambu Sapanga jubona nukujowana gatulonge. Sakaka twiihenga ngati hegupwagiki.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Yefuta jwalongana na Aseja buku Gileadi na bandu bunhenga kuba kilongosi wabu nu nkomana ngondu nkolongu. Yefuta jwapwaga miilu jaki joti ku Misipa kola palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Ndienu, Yefuta antuma mundu kwaka bambu nkolongu Amoni kumpwagi, “Gubi ni milomu boo, na twepani mbaka guika kunapu mu nndema wango?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Bambu nkolongu jwa Amoni jwaajibwa bandu bala, “Aizilaeli pabahika ku Misili bajukua nndema jangu kutumbuli ku losi lwa Amoni mbaka ku losi lwa Yaboki na losi lwa Yoludani. Henu gungelabukia nndema we hogu ku lukwali.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta jwaatuma kabee bandu kwaka bambu nkolongu juku Amoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />mukumpwagila, Yefuta jupwaga, Aizilaeli ngasebajukua nndema wa Amoabu wala nndema wa Aamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Lakini Aizilaeli pabauma ku Misili, bapeta kulukoba bapetila ku nhanga uku Shamu nu kuhika ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Ndi Aizilaeli baatuma bandu kwaka bambu nkolongu juku Edomu kunndoba jwaalekakia kupeta mu nndema waki, lakini bambu nkolongu juku Edomu jwatenda kukana. Ndi bunndoba luusa bambu nkolongu juku Moabu najombi kabee jwatenda kukana. Ndi Aizilaeli baigalia ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Ndienu bajenda mu sapwali kuyongalota nndema uku Edomu nuku Moabu mbaka pabaika upandi golipiti lyoba guku Moabu, babeka kambi kwii ja losi Alinoni. Lakini ngasebajingi lieneu luku Moabu, ndaba losi Alinoni ndi gowabia mpaka guku Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Ndi Aizilaeli baatuma bandu kwaka bambu nkolongu Sioni juku Amoli ku Eshiboni bunndoba jwaalekakia kupeta mu nndema waki ajenda ku nndema jabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Lakini Sioni ngasejwaalekakia Aizilaeli apeta mu nndema jaki. Ndi Sioni jwaakema bandu baki boti nukubeka kambi ku Yaasa, nu kukomana na Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jwaajangatia Aizilaeli kunndapu bambu nkolongu Sioni na bandu baki. Ndienu Aizilaeli bijijukua nndema joti ja Aamoli bababia atama homu. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Bilijukua lieneu loti la Aamoli kutumbuli losi ja Amoni mbaka ku losi Yaboki na toka kulukoba upandi wa kolipiiti lyoba mbaka losi Yoludani upandi wa kolijingi lyoba. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Henu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jwaabenga Aamoli koni Aizilaeli atenda kulingali. Boo, ndaba jakii, gupala kutunyaga nndema wiito? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Boo, ngasekupalika kujuku sindu sejukupeki kisapanga waku Kemoshi? Lakini nndema wokapi goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jwaabengiki bandu baki nu kutupeke twepani, nndema hogu mali jito. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Boo, guwasali wehapa gubii na makili kupeta Balaki mwana waka Zipola jojwabi bambu nkolongu juku Moabu? Jombi ngase jwalosana na Aizilaeli wala kukomana nabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Kwa yaka mia tatu Aizilaeli pababia atama mu musi uku Eshiboni ni ijiji yaki na musi uku Aloeli ni ijiji yaki pamu na misi yoti yeibii pulutengu na losi Alinoni, ndaba jaki ngaseugukombwi musi wegola kipindi sehesi? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nepani ngase ngosi sindu na ndi mana guhenga likosa pagunapu. Bambu Sapanga jojutemu lelenu jwiitenda kutemu kati ja Aizilaeli na Aamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Lakini bambu nkolongu jwa Aamoni ngase jwagahengi lihengu malaobi ga bandu bajwaatumiki Yefuta.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Ndienu Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga junhikila Yefuta, najombi jwaboka kupete ku Gileadi nuku Manase nu kubuja ku Mizipa mu nndema uku Gileadi nu kuendale kujenda kukomana na Aamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta anndagila Bambu Sapanga sukupwaga, “Ana wiinyangatia kwaawesa Aamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />nala jokapi jojwiipita kunza kuhuma mu nyumba jangu kuhika kumbengana paniibia ndenda kubuja baada ja kwaawesa Aamoni hoju jwiibia jwaku wehapa Bambu Sapanga. Hoju nakupiikia litambiku lu kutinii.” <verse eid="JDG 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Ndienu Yefuta jalombuka losi jakomana na Amoni, najombi Bambu Sapanga jwaajangatiya kwaawesa Aamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Jwaawesa ngamaa, jwakamula misi ishilini gagabia ku Aloeli pandu papabia payonguliti Miniti na Abeli Kelamimu. Ndienu Aizilaeli ebaawesa Ahamoni.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamwali waka Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefuta pajakelubuka ku nyumba jaki ku Mizipa, kamwali waki jaboka koni jutogule ili kunzopa koni juona kang'oma nukuhina. Jabiya mwana jwakajika, ngasejabii na mwana mwanalomi wala kamwali jongi. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Paambona jajendula ingobu yaki, jatenda kulela, “Waa kamwali wangu! Guhengiki nguba mia ni kihola nu kusoka ngani mwoju jangu ndaba nhengiki lilaganu na Bambu Sapanga lelule nganhwesi kulitunu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Anzibua, “Atati bangu gupiiki lilobi laku kwaka Sapanga. Gunhengila ngati egunndagila Sapanga, ndienu guhenga ngati ewalapa, ndaba Bambu Sapanga juguhengiki gwaawesa abaja baku Aamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Najombi jaapwagila atati baki, “Noba nhengila lijambu hale. Nepani mbekiya miei mibeli ili kuyongolota kwiitombi kulele ukamwali wangu nepani na ajangu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Atati baki bumpwagila, “Guwesa kujenda.” Najombi andeka jujenda kwa miei mibeli. Ndienu jaboka pamu na akakamwali ajaki, najombi jugulelila ukamwali waki kwi itombi ndaba ngasejawasali ngati jiikuwa sanga kutoguleka. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Ejapeta miei jibeli jela jakelubuka kwa atati baki, Yefuta jahenga ngati ejabiya anndagi Bambu Sapanga. Kamwali we hoju jabiya ngasejuwai kugone na mwanalomi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Na bandu buku Izilaeli bayobali ana, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />kila saka akakamwali buku Izilaeli bajenda kunndele kwa masoba nsesi ili kunkomboka kamwali waka Yefuta hoju jojabii mundu juku Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta na Aefulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Bandu bi likabila laka Efulaimu bakusanya alonda babu nukulomboka losi Yoludani bahika ku Zafoni. Ndi bumpwagila Yefuta, “Boo, ndaba jakii ngaseutukemiki tujenda pamu kukomana na Aamoni? Henu twiijosa nyumba jaku pamu na wamweti gubi nkati jaki.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta jwaapwagila, “Nepani pamu na bandu bangu twabia nu ugombi nkolongu na Ahamoni. Nunndobiki nnyangatia lakini ngasemwaikiki kunhoko. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Panabona ngasenhikiki kunhoko, najenda bila kujogopa kuwa ili kukomana na Ahamoni, na Bambu Sapanga jwanyangatiya naawesa. Boo, ndaba jakii nhikiki kukomana na nepane?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Ndienu Yefuta jwaakusanya bandu boti buku Gileadi nu kukomana nabandu buku Efulaimu na kwaawesa. Bandu buku Efulaimu haba ndi bababia apwagiki, “Mwanganya mwabandu buku Gileadi ndi mwabandu montiliki mu nndema jino ulikabila la Efulaimu, mwatila likabila luku Efulaimu nukutama pikilanda jaka Efulaimu na Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Agileadi bakamula mitandu ya losi luku Yoludani ili kuibali indela ja bandu buku Efulaimu. Kila mala pajwapitila mundu jojutiliki nondu mu nndema waki nu kuloba kupeta hoku bandu buku Geliadi bunndalukia, “Boo, wehapa lee Nhefulaimo?” Anajajibua, “Nganenga,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />Bumpwagila logula lilobi, “Shiboleti” Ana jombi jalogwi, “Siboleti,” ndaba ngasejwawesa kulilogoo saamboni. Ndipala bunkamula nu kunkoma ku mitandu ja losi luku Yoludani. Bandu elupu alobaini ni ibeli buku Efulaimu batenda kukomeka kipindi sehesi.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta jwabia mundu jukuamuli kipindi sehesi mu ndema uku Izilaeli kwa yaka sita. Ndi jwatenda kuwa nu kutagwa ku Geliadi mu musi waki.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizani na Eloni na Abdoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Baada jaka Yefuta Ibizani kuhuma ku Betelehemu jwabia nhamuzi juku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Jombi jwabii na bana akanalomi selasini na akamwali selasini. Na aka kamwali baki selasini baajukua akanalomi ba kunza ju lukolu lwaki na aka kombu baki bajukua akambomba kuhuma kunza julukolu lwaki. Ibizani jwabia nhamuzi juku izilaeli kwa yaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Jwatenda kuwa nu kutagwa kumusi uku Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Baada jaka Ibizani, Eloni juku likabila luku Zebuloni jwabia nhamuzi juku Izilaeli kwa yaka komi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Najombi jwakuwa, nukutagwa ku musi Aiyoloni ku nndema uku likabila luku Zebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Baada jaka Eloni, Abudoni mwana waka Ileli kuhuma ku Pilatoni jwabia nhamusi juku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Jombi jwabia na bana akalomi alobaini na asoko akanalomi selasini babube bakwela maponda sabini. Jwabia nhamuzi juku Izilaeli kwa yaka nani. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Ndi Abudoni jwatenda kuwa, jwatagwa kumusi uku Pilatoni ku nndema ulikabila la Efulaimu ku lieneu la itombi ya Ahamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kusaliwa kwaka Samusoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Aizilaeli bahenga kabee mahakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, najombi jwaaleka Afilisiti baalongusa sakwaang'alisa kwa yaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Ndienu jwabii mundu jumu ku Sola ju likabila la Dani mundu wehoju liina laki ankemika Manoa. Nhwanu waki jwabia ngasejupapa. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Lisoba limu Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga jwatenda kumpiti mmbomba hoju nukumpwagi, “Wehapa ngasegupapa, ngasegubii na bana. Lakini wiipata kitumbu nukubeleka mwana mwanalomi. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Henu gulilingalia ngamaa, wiikunywa divai wala uwembi wala wiikula sindu sokapi sesaguhenga wijetakewa na Sapanga, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />ndaba wiipata kitumbu nu kubeleka mwana mwanalomi. Majunzu gaka mwana hoju wammoga hata kulenga, ndaba jwiibia bumbei kuhenga lihengu laka Sapanga toka mulitumbu la amabu baki mbaka pajikuwa, najombi jwaakombula Aizilaeli mu ulongosi wa Afilisiti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Mmbomba jola jwajenda kumpwagi nndomi waki, “Jwambitila mundu waka Sapanga jojuwe sula jaki jabia ngati juku ntumi jukunani jwaka Sapanga nanatu natenda kujogopa. Ngasenunndaluki kojwaumii wala ngasejwanoguli liina laki. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Lakini jwambwagila, niipata kitumbu nukubeleka mwana mwanalomi. Jwambwagila niikunywa divai wala sindu sukulobe wala kula sokapi sesinhenga niijetakalewa na Sapanga. Ndaba jwiibia bumbei kuhenga lihengu laka Sapanga toka mulitumbu la amabu baki mbaka pajikuwa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Ndienu, Manoa anndoba Bambu Sapanga, kupwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga nundoba guntuma kabee ntumisi waku jola jomuntuma ili jutubola namna junkoa mwana hoju jojisaliwa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Bambu Sapanga jwajowani kuloba kwaka Manoa, nu ntumi jukunani waka Sapanga jola anzendila kabee mmbomba jola pajwabia jutemi kungonda. Lakini Manoa nndomi waka mmbomba jola ngasejwabii pamu najombi. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Mmbomba jola jwajombatika nyatanyata, nukumpwagi nndomi waki, “Linga! Mundu jojwammbitila lisoba lela jumbitii kabee.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa jalongana nu nhwanamundu mbaka kwaka mundu hoju, nukunndaluki, “Bo, wehapa lee ndi mundu jowalongila nu nhwanu wango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Mundu jola anzibua, “Anenganenga.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Ndi Manoa andalukiya, “Henu malobi gaku haga hegiitimia tuhenga majambu boo kwaka mwana we hojo? Boo, ni lihengu laki lee libia kike?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Manoa, “Nhwanu waku jupalika kupwata goka ganunndagalaki. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Jwiikula sindu sokapi sealenganaki kwi mizabibu, wala jwiikunywa divai au sindu sukulobe wala kula sindu sokapi sesanhenga jijetakalewa na Sapanga. Goka ganunndagalaki jagapwata.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa Ampwagila ntumi waka Bambu Sapanga jola, “Pepa koku gutama kidogu tuguhandalia inyama ja kambui.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga jola ampwagila Manoa, “Hata ana mwiinasimisa kutama nganiikuli posu jino. Lakini ana gupai lenganakia litambiku lukutini, umpiikia Bambu Sapanga.” Manoa ngasejwamanyiki hoju jwabia ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Ndienu Manoa ampwagila ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga jola, “Tupwagila liina laku ili tuguhengila isima kipindi malobi gaku pagiitimia.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga anzibua, “Boo, ndaba jaki gupala kumanya liina lango? Liina langu ne nganhwesi kulimanya.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Ndienu Manoa jajukua kambui ni litambiku lu uwembi nukuibeka panani jililibu ili kumpiiki Bambu Sapanga. Najombi Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu Sapanga jahenga hindu yukusangasa koni Manoa nu nhwanu waki atenda kulingali. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Ndi kipindi Manoa nu nhwanu waki pababia alingali mwotu gogunyaka ni mienge hejikwela kunani kwaka Sapanga, kuhuma pandu pukupiki matambiku bummbona ntumi jukunani mu mwotu hogu jukwela kujenda kunani kwaka Sapanga. Ndi Manoa nu nhwanu waki bapega magoti nukunngungamali Sapanga. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Ntumi jukunani hoju ngaseampitila kabee Manoa nu nhwanu waki. Ndi Manoa jwamanya hoju jwabia ntumi waka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Ndienu Manoa ampwagila nhwanu waki, “Sakaka twiitenda kuwa ndaba tumbweni Sapanga.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Lakini nhwanu waki jwajibua, “Ana Bambu Sapanga jwakapala kutukoma, nga jwakajopiki litambiku litu lukutini ni liilebi, wala ngajwakatulangi majambu haga wala kutupeke malagalaki.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Ndienu nhwanu waka Manoa jwabelika mwana mwanalomi na ankema Samusoni. Mwana jola jwatenda kukola najombi Bambu Sapanga jwatenda kumpengee. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Loho waka Bambu Sapanga jatumbulia kuhenga lihengu nkati jaki kipindi pajwabii ku likambi luku Dani, pikilanda juku musi uku Sola nuku Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samusoni nu mmbomba juku Timuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Lisoba limu Samusoni jwahelala kujenda ku Timuna kokuje jwabia ammbweni mmbomba jumu Nfilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Pajwakelabuka kunyumba jwaapwagila ahengo na anyongo baki, “Nummbweni mbomba jumu Nfilisiti ku Timuna. Mwakanyukukiya jubia nhwanu wango.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Lakini atati na anyongo baki baapwaga, “Boo, ngasejubii mmbomba jokapi kati ja alongu baku au kwa bandu bangi mbaka gujenda ukajukua mmbomba kwa Afilisitije banga kummanya Sapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Lakini Samusoni jwaapwagila atati baki, “Nnyukukiya mmbomba hoju ndaba numpai ngamaa.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Ahengo baki na anyongo baki ngasebamanyiki kubanga hogu gwabia mpangu waka Bambu Sapanga gukutaputa indela jakwaalapu Afilisiti. Kipindi sehesi Afilisti babia balongosa koni baang'alisa Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samusoni na ahengo na anyongo baki baboka kujenda ku Timuna. Pabahika ku matui gi mizabibu, kahimba kamu kumpitila nu kuntulami Samusoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Ndi Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga junhenga Samusoni jubiya na makili, nukukapapu kahimba haka ngati mundu hejupapu kambui. Najombi Samusoni ngasejwaapwagila ahengo na anyongo baki lijambu heli.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Ndi jwahelala kujenda ku Timuna na Samsoni jwajenda kulonge na kamwali jola na kamwali jola anndengani ngamaa Samusoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Baada ja masoba kidogu jwakelabuka kabe ku Timuna kunnzuku kamwali jola. Pajwabia mu inndela jwagobuka pulutengu kugulingali ntui gwilihimba lela kumbi kwabia ni inzusi na busi nkati jaki. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ndi jwapakula busi kwa maboku gaki ndi jwabia jukula busi gola koni juendale na sapwali jaki. Pajwakelabuka kwa Ahengo na anyongo baki jwaapeki busi kidogu nabombi batenda kula. Lakini ngase jwaapwagila ana jwapia busi wegola nkati ji liimba leliwii.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Ndienu, Atati baki bajenda kunyumba jaka kamwali we jola, najombi Samusoni jwahenga matola akolakopla ngati hebayobali kuhenga akakombu kipindi sehesi. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Afilisiti pabummbona Samusoni bunndetila aka kombu ajaki selasini atama pamu najombi. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samusoni jwaapwagila, “Nunndaluki sindu. Ana nhwesiki kupwaaga maana ja sindu hesi mu masoba saba sa matola ja ndoa nampekia ingobu ya sapi nhuu selasini ni ingobu yengi selasini ya matola. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Lakini ana nsindwiki kutegu, mwanganya mwiimbekia ingobu selasini ihuu yeinyambiki ni ingobu selasini ya matola, Nabombi bumpwagila tupwagila sindu hesi ili tukijowana.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samusoni jwaapwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Nkati ja jojukula, japita posu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">kwa jojubii na makili sapita sindu sekinoga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Gapeta masoba matatu aka kombu bala ngasebawesa kupwaga maana ja sindu sela.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Lisoba lu nsesi bumpwagila nhwanu waka Samusoni, “Mpembalakia nndomi waku ili jutupwagila mana ja sindu sela, ana ngahela twagujosa mwotu wehapa na bandu ba nyumba ja atati baku. Boo, mutukoka tuhika pani ili mutunyaga mali gito?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Nhwanu waka Samusoni anzendila Samusoni, koni maholi gatenda kumpita nu kumpwagi, “Sakaka gutenda kunzuki, ngasegumbala hata kidogu. Gwalaluki sindu alongu baa na ngasegumbeki maana jake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samusoni anzibua, “Nepani ngasenaapwagi hata ahengo na anyongo bango. Henu niiwesa boo kugupwagi wehapa.?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Lakini jwaendalia kulela ku kipindi soti sesahigali mu masoba saba ga matola ga ndoa. Lisoba la saba Samusoni ampwagila nhwanu waki sindu sela ndaba jwaendalia kunndobalake ngamaa. Nhwanu waki jwajenda nyata kwaapwagi alongu baki. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Lisoba la saba kabula ja lioba kujingi, akakombu bala bumpwagila Samusoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Sindu boo, sekinogiki kupeta busi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Nya jojubii na makili kupeta liimba?” Samusoni jwajibua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ana ngamunkongiki nsumba wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">nga mwakawesiki kukimanya sindu hesi.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Ndienu Loho waka Bambu Sapanga junhenga Samusoni kuba na makili najombi jwajenda ku musi uku Ashikiloni na kwaakoma bandu selasini, ndi jwajukua ingobu ya sapi ya matola na kwaapeke babapwaga mana ja sindu sela. Ndi jwaboka jwajenda kunyumba ja atati na anyongo baki koni jubii niinyela ngani. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Ndienu bumpekia nhwanu waka Samusoni, nkombu jumu jojwabia nkosi waka Samusoni joanzemalia kipindi sukunzuku mmbomba.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Mwenikatai, kipindi sukuhusa inganu, Samusoni jwajukua imbui jwajenda kuntembale nhwanu waki, jwaapwagila akoanu baki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:1">“Mbala kummbona nhwanu wangu kusumba jaki. Lakini akoanu baki ngaseanzetakali kujingi, <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />akoanu baki bumpwagila, nepani naholaliya ngasegumpai kabete. Henu numpeki nkosi waku anzukua kuba nhwanu waki. Hata hela nnuuna waki junyambiki kupeta jombi. Gupepa koku unzukua jombi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samusoni ampwagila, “Sapwali jenu nganiikubi na lawama kwa majambu ganaahengila Afilisiti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Ndienu Samusoni jwajenda kugakamu mabwea mia tatu nu kugakonga mikela jabu pamu mabeli mabeli. Nukugakonga haha ya mwotu kwa kila likundi la mabwea mabeli. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ndienu juipambakia haha ya mwotu nakwagalekake mabwea gala gaguge gajingala mu matui ga Afilisiti nu kujosa mwotu mapei gi inganu ni inganu yeyabia yakona ngaseahusiki, pamu na matui gi mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Afilisiti pabapala kumanya jojuhengiki hela, baapwagila, “Jonioju Samusoni nkowanu waka Mtimuna, juhengiki hela ndaba nkowanu waki anzukwi nhwanu waki nukumpeke nkosi waki anzukua.” Ndienu Afilisiti bajenda kwaakamu atati baki nu kamwali jola na kwaakoma sakwaajosa mwotu.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samusoni jwaapwagila Afilisiti bala, “Ana haga ndi ganhengiki nepani ngamoki pani mbaka nepisa.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Ndienu Samusoni jwaalapula ngamaa na kwaakoma bingi. Ndi jwajenda kutama mu likolu lu lilibu luku Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samusoni jwaawesa Afilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Akomana ngondu ba Afilisiti bahika batama kambi jabu ku nndema uku Yuda nu kujagani mu musi uku Lei. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Bandu buku Yuda baalalukia, “Ndaba jaki nhikiki kutulapula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Nabombi bajibua, “Tuhikiki ili tunkonga Samusoni nukunhenge ngati hejutuhengi.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ndi bandu elupu itatu bi likabila laka Yuda bahelala mbaka kojabii Samusoni ku likolu lelibii mu lilibu luku Etamu nukumpwagi, “Boo, ngasegumanyi lee Afilisiti atenda kutulongosa? Linga henu nkosi goutuhengi!” Samusoni jwajibua, “Ngati hebanhengi ndi henaahengi.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Bumpwagila, “Tuhikiki kugukonga nukugupeleka kwa Afilisiti.” Samusoni jwaapwagila, “Nnapila mbamba kubanga mwanganya mwabeti nganngome.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Nabombi bumpwagila, “Twepani ngatugukome ila twiitenda kukukonga pe migoji nu kugupeleka kwa Afilisiti.” Ndi bunkonga migoji mibeli minyai nu kumpia mu likolu lela.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Pajwahika ku musi uku Lei, Afilisiti bunzendila imbelu koni apega keleli. Apalapa Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga junhikila Samusoni kwa makili ni migoji jebunkongiki mu maboku gaki jatenda kusekukana ngati ingobu nhuu jejikamwi mwotu, ni ipungi yaabuka pai. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samusoni jilibona lihupa linyai li liponda lu munndomu wa mosu jwatumia kwaakoma bandu elupu jimu. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Ndi Samusoni jwapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kupete liupa lu punndomu uliponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">ngomiki bandu elupu jimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kukupete liupa lu punndomu uliponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">naanhengiki kuba ngati malundu gi mitui jiliponda.” <verse eid="JDG 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Pajwajomula kupwaga, jwalekala lihupa heli lupunndomu li liponda lela pandu pala bapakema Lamati Lei, katombi ki lihupa lu punndomu liliponda.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Ndipala Samusoni junkamwi inywita ngamaa. Ndi anndoba Bambu Sapanga koni jupwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga wehapa ndi weguletiki ukombosi gongo, sukundumi nepani nuntumisi waku. Boo, wiineka nguwa na nywita nukungamu Afilisiti haba banga kuseku jando?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Sapanga jwahogula pandu papabii ni libomba ku Lei na masi gatenda kusembalake. Samusoni jwakunywa masi gala na makili gaki gunhikila kabee. Pandu papakabii kalosi ka masi bapakemika Eni Hakole, napombi pakabii ku musi uku Lei mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samusoni jwabia nhamusi jwa Aizilaeli kwa yaka ishilini, mu kipindi sa Afilisiti.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samusoni ku Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Lisoba limu Samusoni jwapiti ku musi uku Gaza, jwaketangini nu mbomba jumu jojuhenga ugoni jwagonila kwaki ikilu joti. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Bandu buku Gaza pabamanya Samusoni jubii kola, bapayonguluta pandu pala nukunhepe pi litanga la musi ikilu kelukelu. “Batama kinunu kulitanga lela ikilu joti babiya awasali awesa kunndendale mbaka ekukusa ili awesa kunkoma.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Lakini Samusoni jwaigalia mu nyumba jela mbaka pamahiku. Pamahiku pala ndi jwatenda kujumuka nu kukamu mapelemu mabeli gagakamulaki litanga lela, jugatupula pamu ni ipungii yaki nukulitoto mbaka panani ji kitombi sesabii pambipi nuku Ebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samusoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Baada ja pala ndi Samusoni ampala mbomba jumu jobunkema Delila jojuwe jwatama ku ligomba luku Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Akolongu ba Afilisiti bunhikila Delila, nukumpwagi, “Umpembalakia Samusoni ili gumanya makili gaki gingi gaumiki kwaa ili tuwesa kunkamu nu kunkonga. Ana guhengiki hela kila jumu witu miti jugupekia ipandi elupu jimu na moja ja madini ga feza.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila ampwagila Samusoni, “Gupepa koku nu gumbwagila makili gaku gaumiki kwako, na mundu juwesa boo, kuguwesa nu kugukonga?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni anzibua, “Ana angongiki kwi migoji saba mibei mu mipengu, niibia jwanga na makili ngati mundu jokapi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Akolongu ba Afilisiti bunndetila Delila migoji mibei saba mu mipengu, najombi ankonga Samusoni kwi migoji heji. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila jwabii jubekiki bandu bunhepalia mu sumba sengi. Ndi ampwagila Samusoni kwa Sauti ngolongu, “Samusoni Afilisiti ahikiki kugutukalila.” Samusoni jujisekulana migoji heji ngati nyusi ya pamba heikupa mwotu. Ndienu nga jojwamanyiki sili ja makili gake.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila ampwagila Samusoni, “Wehapa gutei kunyoke nu kungonga. Gupepa koku gumbwagila namuna heawesa kugukonga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samusoni jwajibua, “Ana angongiki kwi migoji minyai jejuje jibia ngaseawaiki kujitumia, niibia jwanga na makili ngati mundu jongi jokape.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Ndienu Delila jwajukua migoji minyai nukunkonga naku. Ndi ampwagila Samusoni kwa sauti ngolongu, “Samusoni! Afilisiti ahikiki kugutukalila!” Kipindi sehesi kwakabii na bandu kusumba sengi atenda kunhepale. Lakini Samusoni jujisekula migoji jela ngati nyusi jebunkongiki mu maboku gaki.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila ampwagila Samusoni, “Mbaka sajenu wakona gumbowa lihamu nu gutei kungonga enu gumbwagila namuna heawesa kugukonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samusoni ampwagila, “Ana gulokiki majunzu gangu mabutu saba nu kukonga mu ntandiu gwiingobu nukungonga mu mpini lukuloke ingobu, niibia jwanga na makili ngati mundu jokapi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Samusoni pajwabia jutei kugone Delila jugaloka majunzu gaka Samusoni mabutu saba nukugakonga nu nntandiu gwiingobu nukukonga mu mpini. Ndi ampwagila Samusoni, “Samusoni! Afilisiti ahika kugutukalila.” Samusoni jwajumuka mulugonu nukutupu mpini sela nu kujendu nntandiu wiingobu gola.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila ampwagila Samusoni, “Guwesa boo, kupwaga gutenda kumbala akati ngasegulandi hegumbala jene? Gungoki mala ja tatu henu. Ngasegumbwagi makili gaku gahuma kwako.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila pajwaendalia kunsumbuu ngani kwa malobi gingi kila lisoba mbaka jatenda kusoka mu loho jaki kalibu kuwa, <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />ngase jwawesa kuhinakali, jwahamua kumpwagi sili jaki kupwaga, “Majunzu gangu ngasenhwahiki kugamoga. Nepani ambiiki kwaka Sapanga tumbuka mu litumbu la amabu bangu. Ana amogiki makili gangu giitenda kumoka, na niibia jwanga na makili ngati mundu jokapi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Ndi Delila pajwabona ampwagi Sili jaki joti, jwaakema akolongu ba Afilisiti na kwaapwagi, “Nhwika kabee sapwali jenze Samusoni jumbwagi sili jaki joti.” Akolongu ba Afilisiti bunzendila Delila koni buntotuli madini ga feza gabundagila. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Na Delila anhenga Samsoni jugonila lugonu mu majugu gaki, ankema mundu ammoga mabutu saba gamajunzu gaki gala. Ndienu Delila jwatumbulia kunnsumbuu Samsoni ili jujumuka lakini makili gaki gabia gumpitiki. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila ampwagila Samsoni, “Samsoni! Afilisiti ahika kugutukalila!” Samsoni jwajumuka mu lugoni koni juwasali juwesa kuboka nukulihoko ngati pa mwandi. Kumbi ngasejwamanyiki kubanga Bambu Sapanga jwabia anndekiki. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Afilisiti bunkamula nukuntupu miu nukuhele naku mbaka ku Gaza, bunkonga kwapengu ya shaba, nukunnhengesa lihengu lu kupola uwembi ku ligelesa. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Lakini majunzu gaki gatumbulia kukola kabee baada jukumoga kwaki.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samusoni jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Akolongu ba Afilisiti bakusanyiki ili kukipiiki litambiku kisapanga sabu sebikikema Dagoni. Ndi babia atenda tipati koni ajemba, “Kisapanga situ sunkamwi mbaja witu Samusoni.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Bandu pabummbona Samusoni bikilumbalia kisapanga sabu sukupwaga, “Kisapanga situ jutuwesisi kunkamu mmbaja witu jojwabia juhalabana nndema jiu na kwaakoma bandu bitu bingi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Pababiya atenda kutogule ngani mu mioju jabu baapwaga, “Munndeta Samusoni jutuhinila. Ndienu ampiya Samsoni muligelesa koni ansokonza nukummbeka pikilanda ji mipendi mibeli ju ukuta.” <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samusoni ampwagila nkombu jojwabia jutenda kunndongosa, “Gunekakia ng'usa mipendi jejikamulaki nyumba jenze ili nhwesa kujegamane.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Linyumba lela labia litweli bandu, akolongu boti ba Afilisiti babia pala na kuugolu babia bandu elupu itatu akanalomi na aka mbomba koni bunndingali Samusoni hejwahina.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Ndipala Samusoni anndoba Bambu Sapanga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga nuguloba gungombuka. Gunyegala makili mala jimu pee ili naalepa kisasi Afilisiti baatupwi miu gangu gabeli.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samusoni jujikamula mipendi mibeli jejabia jikamulaki linyumba lela kuboku kumu mpendi gumu nu kuboku kongi mpendi gwapili koni jubii tayali kuikanga. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Ndi jajamaliya, “Nguwa pamu na Afilisiti,” jwakanga kwa makili gaki goa. Linyumba lela laahabukia akolongu ba afilisiti bala na bandu boti bababia nkati mola. Bababia akuiki kipindi sa kuwa kwaki babia bingi kupeta bandu bajwaakoma kipindi sa womi waki. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Alongu baki na bandu bu lukolu lwaki bahika kunnzuku kujenda kuntaga pikilanda ja musi uku Sola na musi uku Eshitaoli pi likabuli laka Manoa, atati baki. Samusoni jwabia kilongosi jwa Aizilaeli kwa yaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Imong'umong'u yaka Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kipindi hesi kwakabi na mundu jumu juku nndema ututombi gogubi ku Efulaimu jobunkema Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Lisoba limu jwaapwagila amabu baki, “Mwaa amabu nunzoana mugunndigi mbamba mundu jojajibiki ipandi elupu jimu na mia jimu ya madini ga feza, nepani ndi nenajibiki hipandi yeyela minaku nepani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Amabu baki bapwaaga, “Mwanangu, Bambu Sapanga jugupengila.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika jwaakelabukia amabu baki ipandi elupu jimu na mia jimu ja madini ga feza gala. Amabu baki baapwaga, ili yaambamba yembiiki yagupata, madini ga feza ganga niipia kwaka Bambu Sapanga na ili kulenganake imong'umong'u yukubasa nukumamatiki madini ga feza kwa ndaba jaku. Ndienu niibia ngati nugukelabuki wehapa ipandi heyi ya madini ga feza. <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika pajwaakelabukia amabu baki madini ga feza haga, amabu baki bajukua ipandi mia ibeli ya madini ga feza numkupeke pundi najombi jwabasa imong'umong'u yukubasa nukuimamatika madini ga feza. Kimong'umong'u hesi bikibeka nkati ja nyumba jaka Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Ndienu Mika jwabia na pandu paki pukukilumbali kisapanga. Jwalenganaki kizibau saku nngolu wiisapanga yaki ni imong'umong'u, nu kunhenga mwana jumu kati ja bana baki kuba nngolu wii isapanga yaki. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Masoba gegala ngasebabii na bambu nkolongu mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Kila mundu jwahenga sokapi sejukibona kuba saamboni.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Masoba agalaga jwabia nkombu jumu Nndawi ku musi uku Betelehemu mu nndema uku Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Nkombu hoju jwaboka ku musi uku Betelehemu mu nndema uku Yuda nukujenda kutaputa pandu pangi pukutama. Mu sapwali jaki jwahika ku nyumba jaka Mika mu nndema ututombi uku Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika anndalukia, “Guhumiki kwako?” Najombi jwajibwa, nepani nu Nndawi kuhuma musi uku Betelehemu mu nnndema uku Yuda. Nandaputa pandu pukutama.<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika ampwagila, “Gutama pamu na nepane gubia kwangu ngati atati nu nngolu wango. Nagulepa ipandi komi ya madini ga feza kila saka na kila segupala kwa ndaba jukutama kwaku.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Nndawi jola jatenda kujetakela, na jwatama kola na kuba ngati jumu jwa bana baka Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Najombi Mika anhimika nkombu jola kuba nngolu waki na jombi jatama kunyumba jaka Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Ndi jwapwaga, “Henu manya Bambu Sapanga jihengila gaamboni, ndaba jumbeki Nndawi hajo jubia ngati nngolu wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na bandu bi likabila la Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Masoba gegala ngasejwakabii bambu nkolongu mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Ndi likabila la Dani labia litaputa lieneu labu lukutama beni, ndaba mpaka muda wehogu babia ngasebaabaguli pandu pabu beni kati ja makabila guku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Ndipala bandu bi likabila laka Dani bahagula bandu nhwanu bana makili kuhuma ku Eshitaoli na Sola na kwaalagalaki ajenda kulaluki kwa sili nndema. Bandu haba bapita kila mukibeleku silikabila la Dani bahika mu nndema ututombi uku Efulaimu, munyumba jaka Mika, nukugone homu ikilu jela. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Pababia pambipi na nyumba jaka Mika bijimanya Sauti juku nndawi jola. Bupwata nukunndaluki, “Nya jojuguletiki kongone? Gubii ni lihengu boo kongone?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Jombi jwaajibwa, “Mika jujetangini na nepani junepa lupija mia nunngolu waki.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Nabombi bumpwagila, “Gupepa koku gutulalukia kwaka Sapanga ana sapwali jitu mbaka jikubi jaamboni.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Nngolu jola jwaapwagila, “Nzenda kulukwali Bambu Sapanga junzangatiya mwanganya mu sapwali jinu jibiya jaamboni.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Ndi bandu nhwanu haba baboka, nukuhika ku Laishi. Baabona bandu bababia atama kola, na namuna hebabia atemi kulukwali ngati bandu buku Sidoni. Babia bandu banga kukupala kukomana na banga na wasiwasi na ngasebapongukewa maitaji gokapi. Babia kutali na bandu buku Sidoni na ngaseapai kutama na bandu bangi.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Ndi bandu babapiti kulaluki nndema bala bakelabuka kwaka alongu babu ku Sola kola, nuku Eshitaoli na alongu babu baalalukia, “Mutuleti lijambu bole?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Bombi bapwaga nzumukania, “Tujendaniya tukugulapula nndema hogu. Tugubweni nndema hogu, sakaka ndi ndema gogunyambiki kulema nukupugi. Boo, mwitama pamba pee sanga kuhenga sindo? Mwikabaki kukwela kujenda kuguhenga nndema hogu gubiya gwitu. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Pamwihika kola mwaaketania bandu banga kuba na wasiwasi jokapi. Nndema hogu ndi nkolongu nu gubii na kila sindu na Sapanga jujibei mu maboku gitu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ndi bandu mia sita bi likabila laka Dani koni abi na hindu yabu yukukomane ngondu baboka kuhuma ku Sola nuku Eshitaoli nukujenda kukomana ngondu. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Bajenda kubeka kambi jabu ku Kiliati Yealimu mu nndema uku Yuda. Ndi mana pandu pala upandi golijingi lyoba uku Kiliati Yealimu bapakema Mahane Dani mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kuhuma hoku bajenda ku nndema gogubii nu tutombi ku Efulaimu nu kuhika ku nyumba jaka Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Bandu nhwanu bala babapiti kulaluki majambu mu nndema uku Laishi baapwagila alongu babu, “Boo, mmanyiki nyumba jimu kati ja haye jibii ni kizibau, imong'umong'u isokusoku yu nyumba ni kimong'umong'u sukubasa nu kumamatika madini ga feza? Henu nhwasalia semwihenga.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ndi bandu nhwanu bala bababia alaluki majambu gunndema bajenda ku nyumba jaka Mika nukujingi nkati nukulaluki majambu guku nkombu nndawi jola. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Kipindi sesela bandu mia sita bala bi likabila la Dani koni abii na hindu yabu yukukomane ngondu bajema pilitanga la musi. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Bandu nhwanu bala babajenda kulaluki majambu gupunndema bala bajingala nkati, bajukua kimong'umong'u yukubasa ni kizibau sela ni imong'ong'u ikisapanga. Kipindi sesela nngolu jola jwabia jujemi punndiyangu pamu na bandu mia sita bala baabii na hindu yukukomane ngondu.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Kipindi nngolu hoju pajaabona bandu bala ajingi mu nyumba jaka Mika, nukujuku kimong'umong'u sukubasa na seamamatiki madini ga feza ni kizibau ni imong'umong'u yengi, jaalaluki, “Nhenga kike?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Nabombi bumpwagila, “Tumbala na gupunga nndomu waku, gujenda pamu natwepani gubia gungolu witu na ngati mundu ukutupeke mawasu witu au gubona boo kupalika kwaku kuba nngolu waka mundu jumu au kuba nngolu wi likabila loti la Aizilaeli?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Nngolu jola jwatoguli ngamaa, jwajukua kizibau sela ni kimong'umong'u ikisapanga sela ni imong'umong'u yengi sukubasa.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Ndi batumbulia sapwali jabu koni alonguki bana babu ni mipugu na mali gabu. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Pababia ahikiki kutali kidogu kuhuma kunyumba jaka Mika, Mika jamanya hindu yaki atei kujuku, ndienu jaakema bandu baki baatamika pambipi na Mika bakusanyika pamu, na kwaakagu bandu bi likabila laka Dani na batenda kwaaketane. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Ndi baapegila keleli, nabombi bandu bilikabila la Dani batenda kung'anambuka nu kunndaluki Mika, “Gubii na sindu boo, mbaka gutupwatiki pamu ni likundi loti heli.”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika jwapwaga, “Mwanganya nzukwii isapanga yangu yenililenganaki kabee munzukwi nu nngolu wangu na ngasenneki sokape. Henu nhwesa boo, kunaluki mi na sindu bole?” <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Bandu bi likabila laka Dani bumpwagila, “Nambanga gutami kinunu ana ngahela ajitu baabi ni inyela awesa kugutukali nawehapa guwesa kuhoa womi waku na womi waalongu baku.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Mika pajwabona bumpetiki makili jwatenda kung'anambuka nukubuja kunyumba na bandu bi likabila la Dani batenda kuyetuana.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Bandu bi likabila la Dani bala biijukua hindu yela yejwabia Mika juilenganaki, bunzukua nu nngolu waki jojwabia jutenda kunhudumi. Ndi bajenda bandu ba musi uku Laishi baalapula na kwaakoma bandu bababia atama mola sulukwali na sanga kujogopa nu kugutini musi we hogu kwa mwotu. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Bandu ba musi hogu ngasebabia na mundu jwakwaahoko ndaba babia kutali na musi uku Sidoni, kabee ngasebajongini na bandu bangi. Musi hogu wabi mu ligomba luku Beti Lehobu. Bandu bi likabila la Dani buusenga kabee nu kutama momu. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Bang'anambua liina la musi hogu nu kuukema Dani, kulengana ni liina la ahoku babu jojwabia mwana waka Izilaeli yani Yakobu. Lakini musi wehogu pu utumbuli bugukemika Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Bandu bi likabila laka Dani bijijemika sanamu jukubasa jela, najombi Yonasani mwana waka Gelishomu mwana waka Musa jwabia nngolu wabu. Alongu babu kabee babia agolu bi likabila la Dani mbaka bandu bunndema hogu pabaapelika kuluhamila. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Kipindi soti Nyumba jaka Sapanga pajabia ku Shilo, bandu bi likabila la Dani bikilumbalia kimong'umong'u sukubasa sesuse jalenganakia Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Nndawi ni libangu laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Mumasoba gehaga Aizilaeli ngaseabii na bambu nkolongu, kwabia nu nndawi jumu jojwabia jutama ngati nngeni kutali na misi jengi mu nndema uku Efulaimu. Mundu hoju jwajukwii libangu kuhuma ku Betelehemu ku nndema uku Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Lakini libangu lela latenda ugoni na mundu jongi nu Nndawi jola jatenda kuhyome, anndeka jubuja kunyumba ja atati baki ku Beteleemu nukutama kwa miei nsesi. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lisoba limu nndomi waki jwajenda kuntaputa, jwapala kulonge naku sapi nukunkelabu kunyumba jaki. Ndi mwanalomi jola jwajenda pamu nu ntumisi waki na maponda mabeli. Pabahika kola mmbomba jola ampelika nkati kwa atati baki, nabombi akoanu baki anzopa sukutogule. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Akoanu baki ngaseanzetaki juboka panyumba najombi jwatama kola kwa masoba matatu, Nndawi jola nu ntumisi waki bakula na kunywa nukugone kola. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Lisoba lunsesi jajumuka pulukela ngani, jiliandia kuboka lakini atati baka mmbomba jola bumpwagila, “Kula posu hoti kidogu ili gupata makili ndienu guboka.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Ndi bandu abeli bala batenda kutama, bakula na kunywa pamu. Ndi akoanu baki bala bumpwagila, “Pepa koku gugonila pamba ikilu jenze nu kutogule.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Mundu jola pajwajema koni jupala kuboka, akohanu baki anndobiki ngamaa juigalia najombi jwatenda kuigali ikilu jela. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Lisoba lu nhwanu mndawi jola jwatenda kujumuka pulukela koni jupala kuboka. Lakini atati baki mmbomba jola bumpwagila, “Gukula oti posu ili gupata makili, gulendalia lioba mutu ndi guboka.” Ndi boti abeli bakula pamu.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Nndawi jola pamu ni libangu laki pamu nu nntumisi waki pabajumuka kuboka, akoanu baki bumpwagila Nndawi jola, “Henu lioba lijingi ni ikilu jiegali. Gugonila pamba na gutoguliaje. Kilabu pulukela ngani wiilaba nu kutumbuli sapwali jukubuja kunyumba.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Lakini nndawi jola jwakana kugone kola ikilu jela. Ndi jwajumuka nu kuboka jwaika pambipi na musi guku Yebusi goguwe masoba gani agukema Yelusalemu. Jwabia na maponda mabeli gala gagabia bagatandiki ingobu pamu ni libangu laki. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Pababia ahegali ku musi uku Yebusi, lyoba labia litenda kujingi, najombi ntumisi ampwagila nkolongu waki, “Gupepa koku, tujingala mu musi gongo gwa Ayebusi, tugonila momu ikilu jenu.” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Nkolongu waki ampwagila, ngatwiijingi mu musi wa bandu ageni gwanga gwa Aizilaeli. Tuendalia na sapwali mbaka ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Tukasana twakahika kumusi uku Gibea au ku Lama na twakagonila musi gumu kati ja misi jeheji. <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ndienu, baendalia na sapwali jabu mbaka lioba palajingala babia pambipi na musi wa Gibea gogugwe gwabia musi wilikabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Bajingala kumusi uku Gibea ili awesa kugone momu ikilu. Bajenda kutama pulubanza lwa musi wala ngamundu jojaajopa kunyumba jaki ili agonila.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Pakamii pala jabia nseja jumu jahuma munngonda jaki. Nseja hoju jwabia mwenei ju nndema ji itombi yuku Efulaimu na jwabia jutama ku kumusi uku Gibea. Bandu bu punndema gola babia bilikabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Nseja hoju pajwalinga nu kummbona mundu jojwabia mu sapwali pajwabia mu lubanza kola, anndalukia, “Uhumiki kwako na gujenda kwako?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Najombi jwajibua, “Tuhumiki ku Betileemu ku nndema uku Yuda na tujenda kunndema ukutali gogubii pandu pi itombi yuku Efulaimu. Hoku ndi konndama na sajenu nhuma ku musi uku Betileemu ku Yuda na nyenda kunyumba jangu kokuje Bambu Sapanga atenda kunndumbali, ngamundu jokapi jojutujopiki kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Lakini twepani twaatumisi baku tubii na manyai na nndele wa kula maponda gito. Kabee tubii na mabumunda na divai, hei indosa nepani ni libangu langu nu nkombu witu jotulongini naku. Ngasetukipai sindu sokapi.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Nseja jola jwapwaga, “Lukwali lubia pamu na mwanganya! Tubokaninya kunyumba jangu. Nukumpekia hindu yoti yempala ila mwiigone kulubanza lwa musi hago.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Ndi jwaapelika kunyumba jaki na kwaapeke nndelee maponda gaki. Bandu bala bababia mu sapwali basamba mu magolu gabu, bakula na kunywa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Pababia atenda kulijeka, bandu abaja ba musi gola bahika sukusituki mu nyumba jela nu kukong'onda punndyangu. Bumpwagila nseja jojubii na nyumba jola, “Mpia kunza mwanalomi jola jojwahika kwaku, tugonila naku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Lakini nseja jojwabii na nyumba jola jwahika kunza na kwaampwagi, “Nga hela mwaalongu bango, nunndoba mwiihenga ubaja hogu. Hoju nngeni wango mwanhenge kihakau hesi. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Jubii kamwali wangu jojuwe jwakona kamwali ngasejuwaiki kugone na mwanalomi kabee libii kabe libangu luku nngeni wango. Nnekakia naapia kunza mwaajukua na kwaahenge ngati hempala, lakini mundu ajo mwanhenge lijambu likihakau heli.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Lakini akanalomi bala ngasebunzowani. Henu Nndawi jola julijukua libangu laki lela nukulipia kunza. Nabombi bunzukua nukugone naku nu kunhenge majambu gi iyoni ikilu joha mbaka pulukela. Pakwahegaliya kukusa bunndeka juyetuana.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Pulukela mmbomba jola jwahika mbaka punndyangu ja nyumba juku nseja jola mojwabii nkolongu waki, jwaabuka pai punndyangu pala nukutama pala mbaka pulukela ngani. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Nkolongu juka mmbomba jola pajwajumuka pulukela, jwaogula milyangu ja nyumba nu kupita kunza ili juendalia na sapwali. Apalapala julikolila libangu lela ligoni pai punndiyangu, maboku gaki gakamwi pelemu junndyangu. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Ampwagila, “Gujema tuboka.” Lakini jombi ngasejwajibwiki sindo. Anzukua nukummbeka panani jiliponda laki nu kumpeleka mbaka kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Pajwahika kunyumba jaki jwajukua mpamba nukulisekuseku libangu laki lela ipandi komi niibeli. Kila likabila la Izilaeli jilipelakiya kipandi simu. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Boti bababona lijambu lela bapwaga, “Lijambu ngati heli ngaseliwaiki kubonekana toka lisoba lebahika Aizilaeli kuhuma ku Misili mbaka lelenu. Tuliholaliya nukupwagani nukuamu tuhenga kike.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli biliandaa ku ngondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Bandu boti buku Izilaeli, kuhuma kila pandu kutumbulii ku Dani mbaka ku Belisheba, pamu na bandu bu nndema guku Gileadi bakusanyiki ku Mizipa palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Aka kilongosi boti ba makabila ga Aizilaeli bahika palongi ja bandu baka Sapanga. Babii jumula alonda laki nsesi baabii na hindu yukukomane ngondu baajenda kwa magolu. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Kipindi sehesi bandu bi likabila la Benyamini bajowana Aizilaeli bangi babia akusanyiki ku Mizipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Ndienu Aizilaeli bunndalukia mwanalomi nndawi jola, “Tupwagila kihakau sehesi sahengika bole?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Nndawi jola jojabii nndomi u libangu jola, jwaajibua, “Nepani ni libangu langu twahika ku musi uku Gibea, musi ulikabila la Benyamini ili tugonila kola ikilu. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Lakini bandu ba musi uku Gibea bahika ikilu nukujiyongalota nyumba mo nabia ng'oni. Bapala kungoma, nu kulilimba libangu langu kwa makili mbaka latenda kuwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Nepani najukua nntui waki, nunsekula sekula ipandi ipandi nukuipeleka kwa makabila goti guku Izilaeli, ndaba atei majambu gukusukisa na galia mu nndema uku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Henu mwa Aizilaeli mpwaganinya nukutemu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Bandu boha pamu bajema nukupwaga, “Ngamundu jokapi kati jitu jojwiibuja ku lihema laki au kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Henu lende ndi letwiihenga ku Gibea, twiipega gudugudu ili kumanya namuna ja kwaalapu. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Twiihagula bandu komi mu kila likundi la bandu mia jimu kuhuma makabila goti ga Aizilaeli, bandu mia jimu mu kila bandu elupu jimu na bandu elupu jimu mu kila bandu elupu komi. Haba biibia ni lihengu la kwaalete posu bandu babibia ni lihengu la kwaalapu na bandu ba musi guku Gibea mu nndema uku Benyamini ndaba ju ubaja wabu nu kihakau seahengiki mu Izilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ndi akomana ngondu boha buku Izilaeli bakusanyika kwa moju gumu kugulapu musi uku Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Bandu ba makabila guku Izilaeli baatuma bandu kila pandu bi likabila luka Benyamini, koni bakapwaga, “Boo, ubaja boo gongo gogupiiti kwino? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Henu mutupekia bandu haba abaja buku Gibea ili twaakoma nukuhoha kihakau kuhuma kwa Aizilaeli.” Lakini bandu bilikabila laka Benyamini ngasebaajowania alongu babu Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ndienu Abenjamini bakusanyika ku Gibea kuhuma kila musi wabu ili kukomana na bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Bandu bi likabila la Abenyamini bakusanyika kuhuma mu misi jabu jengi, akomana ngondu elupu ishilini na sita baabi na hindu yukukomane, nabombi bandu ba musi uku Gibea baakusanya akomana ngondu mia saba banga kujogopa ngondu. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Kati ja akomana ngondu haba babahaguliwa kwabia na bandu mia saba babatumia kuboku kwa mangenga, kila jumu jwawesa kuleke lilibu nukulenga mu majunzu sanga kukose. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Nabombi Aizilaeli sanga kwaabalangi bandu baka Benjamini bakusanya akanalomi laki nsesi baatumi upanga boti babia baawesa kukomana.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizileli akomana na Abenjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Aizilaeli bajenda ku Beseli kunndoba Bambu Sapanga ili amanya likabila lelilongulia kujenda kukomana na bandu bi likabila la Abenyamini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Bambu Sapanga jwaapwaga, “Likabila la Yuda lilongulia hoti.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Ndi Aizilaeli bajenda kilabu jaki pulukela, babeka kambi jabu pambipi na musi uku Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Aizilaeli baboka nu kujenda kukomana na bandu bi likabila laka Benyamini bijipanga kwa ndaba ja ngondu koni agulingali musi uku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Bandu bi likabila la Benyamini bapita kunza ja musi uku Gibea nu kukomana na Aizilaeli ni lisoba heli baakoma bandu elupu ishilini na abeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Lakini Aizilaeli bilipekia moju, bilipanga kabee kukomana pandu pabilipanga lisoba lukutumbuliya. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Kabula ja haga Aizilaeli bakweli ku Beseli bajenda kunndoba Bambu Sapanga mbaka pakamii. Ndi bunndoba Sapanga, “Boo, tujenda kabee twakakomana na alongu bitu bi likabila la Abenyamine?” Bambu Sapanga jwajibua, “Nzendania mwakakomana nabu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Ndi lisoba la pili bandu buku Izilaeli bajenda kukomana na bandu bi likabila la Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Lisoba la pili lela bandu bi likabila la Abenyamini bapita ku Gibea na kwaalapu Aizilaeli na kwaakoma bandu elupu kumi na nani bababii ayobali kutumii mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Akomana ngondu boti buku Izilaeli bajenda ku musi uku Beseli. Bapilakiya kola palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga koni alobalake nukupunga mbaka pakamii. Ndi bumpiikia Bambu Sapanga matambiku gukutini na matambiku gulukwali. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Aizilaeli bajenda kunndoba Bambu Sapanga ku Beseli, kwa ndaba kipindi hesi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga labiya hoku, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Fineasi mwana waka Eleazali, nsoko waka Aloni jwabia nngolu. Aizilaeli bumpwagila Fineasi bunndalukia Bambu Sapanga, “Boo, tujenda kabee kukomana naaka alongu bito, bandu bi likabila la Abenyamine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Bambu Sapanga jwaapwagila, “Nzendania. Kilabu nitenda kunhenga mwaawesa.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ndi Aizilaeli baahia bandu kuyongalota musi uku Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Ndienu Aizilaeli bajenda kukomana na bandu bi likabila laka Benjamini mu lisoba la tatu. Bilipanga kukomana na bandu ba musi uku Gibea ngati hebahenga pu utumbuli. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Ndi bandu bilikabila la Abenjamini bapita nukujenda kukomana na Aizilaeli, Aizilaeli baboka ili kwaahuta Abenjamini ajenda kunza ja musi. Abenjamini batumbulia kwaalapu nakwaakoma bandu ngati selasini buku Izilaeli ngati ebahenga kipindi sumunyuma. Bangi baakoma mwiindela ngolongu jejijenda ku Beseli na jejijenda ku Gibea kumigonda. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Akomana ngondu bilikabila la Abenjamini bapwaga, “Twaalapwi ngati kipindi sekipetiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Lakini Aizilaeli bapwaga, “Twepani tutila ili kwaahuta mbaka tuhika kutali niindela ngolongu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Ndienu akomana ngondu boti buku Izilaeli bahika ku Baali Tamali nukujema hapa bilipanga ili akomana. Kipindi sese akomana ngondu bangi buku Izilaeli bababiya atei kujoba upandi golijingi lyoba guku Gibea batenda kupiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Na akomana ngondu bangi elupu komi buku Izilaeli baamanyiki kukomana sapi baatukaliya bandu buku Gibea. Elahika lisoba heli kwabiya na ngondu ngolongu, lakini bandu buku Benjamini ngasebanyiki ngati kukomeka kwabu kutei kuhika. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Bambu Sapanga jwaawesa bandu bi likabila laka Benjamini palongi ja Aizilaeli. Aizilaeli baakoma bandu bi likabila laka Benyamini elupu ishilini nu nhwanu na mia jimu. Haba boti babakuwiki babia akomana ngondu babawesa kutumi hindu yukukomane. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ndi bandu bi likabila laka Benjamini babona asindwiki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Aizilaeli hebawesa Abenjamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Aizilaeli babuja mu nyuma ngati atenda kwaatila bandu bi likabila la Abenjamini, ndaba baahobalia ajabu babajobiki kugulapu musi uku Gibea hela ndi namuna Aizilaeli hebawesa. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Bandu babaabekiki kuguhepale musi gola bapita nyatanyata nukugulapu musi uku Gibea na kwaakoma ku upanga boti bababia mola. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli na akomana bangi boti babajobiki bajetangini kuhenga nginyuli. Bajetangania kubanga babibia atenda kwahepale pabijingala mu musi biipambakiya mwotu nkolongu ni liyoi laki likwela kunani ngati likongobu, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />ndienu akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli bang'anambuka na kwaatukali akomana ngondu buku Benjamini bababia atenda kwaabenga. Kipindi sesela akomana ngondu bi likabila laka Benjamini babia baakomiki akomana ngondu ngati selasini buku Izilaeli nu kupwagani, “Twaalapwi ngati puutumbuli pala.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Lakini likongobu li liyoi lela palatumbulia kupiti pa musi, akomana ngondu bi likabila laka Benyamini pabalingalia munyuma jabu basangia kulibona liyoi lipita mmusi jabu. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Ndi Aizilaeli bang'anumbuka na akomana ngondu bi likabila laka Benyamini bapata kiholu ndaba babona kuwa kwabu kuhegali. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Ndienu bang'anambuka na kwaatila Aizilaeli kujenda ku lukoba, lakini ngondu jaaketani nu kulibona abi pikilanda ja makundi ga akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli na kila nkomana ngondu jojapitila kumisi jela batenda kunkoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Aizilaeli baalapula bandu bi likabila laka Benjamini kila upandi, baapwataliya kuboka kumusi uku Noha mbaka upandi golipiti lyoba uku musi wa Gibea koni baakoma bandu bingi. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Lisoba akomana ngondu elupu kumi na nani bi likabila la Benjamini bababia awesa kukomana ngondu sapi batenda kwaakoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Akomana ngondu bangi bi likabila laka Benyamini bang'anambuka nu kutila kulukoba mbaka ku lilibu luku Lemoni. Bangi elupu nhwanu bakuwa mu indela ngolongu pababia atenda kutila. Aizilaeli baendalia kwaabenga kwa makili bandu bi likabila la Benjamini mbaka ku musi uku Gidomu na kwaakoma bandu elupu ibeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Lisoba heli akomana ngondu boti bi likabila la Benjamini bababia baakomiki babia elupu ishilini nu nhwanu, babube babia akomana ngondu ba sapi baatumi saamboni hindu yukukomane.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Lakini akanalomi mia sita bilikabila la Benjamini bawesa kutili kulukoba mbaka ku lilibu luku Limoni na batama kola kwa muda wa miei nsesi. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli baang'anumbukia bandu bangi bi likabila laka Benjamini na kwaakoma bandu boti pamu ni inyama na kila sindu sebikikolila homu. Na misi joti bijijosa mwotu.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Abenjamini baataputi akammbomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Aizilaeli babia alapiki mbamba ku Mizipa kubanga, “Ngajukubi hata mundu jumu kati jabu jojwanndekila kamwali waki jujukulika kwa bandu bi likabila luku Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Baada ja ngondu heji bandu buku Izilaeli bajenda mbaka ku Beseli batama hoku palongi jaka Sapanga mbaka pakamii. Bapega keleli nu kulela ku usungu nkolongu. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Bapwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga juku Izilaeli, boo ndaba jaki lijambu lende lipiiti mundema guku Izilaeli, boo, ndaba jakii likabila limu luku Izilaeli litenda kuhoba?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Kilabu jaki bandu bajumuka lukela ngani, basenga pandu pukupiki matambiku hoku, bapia litambiku lukutini na matambiku gu lukwali. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Ndienu balalukiana, “Boo, mu makabila goa ga Aizilaeli kibi kikundi sokapi sanga kujenda ku nkutanu sesahengika palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga?” Ndaba babia alapiki kupwaga mundu jokapi jojwiibia ngasejuhikiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ku Mizipa kupalika jukomika. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Lakini Aizilaeli baabonila ikia alongu babu bilikabila laka Benjamini, bapwaaga, “Lelenu likabila limu luku Izilaeli likuwike.” <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Henu twiihenga kii ili kwapeke akambomba akanalomi bi likabila laka Benyamini baahigali? Ndaba twabii tulapiki kupete liina laka Bambu Sapanga kupwaga, “Ngatwaapeke akakamwali bitu abia ahanu babu!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Bapala kumanya ana kwabia ni likundi lokapi lilikabila luku Izilaeli lelule ngaselahikiki pu nkutanu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ku Mizipa. Bamanya ngamundu jokapi kuhuma ku Yabeshi Gileadi jojwahikiki ku nkutanu gola. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Aizilaeli pabaabalanga bandu ku Mizipa babona ngamundu jokapi juku Yabeshi Gileadi jojwahikiki. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ndi likundi la bandu buku Izilaeli lapeleka akomana ngondu baki ba sapi elupu kumi na mbili baabii na makili na kwaalagalaki, “Nzendania mwakaakoma bandu buku Yabeshi Gileadi pamu akambomba na bana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Hela ndi hemwiihenga, mwaakoma akanalomi boti na akambomba boti baawaiki kugone na mwanalomi.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Ndi baakolila bandu baatama ku Yabeshi Gileadi akakamwali mia nsesi banga kugone na akanalomi, nabombi baajukua nu kujenda nabu ku likambi ku Shilu mu nndema uku Kaanani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Ndi likundi loti la bandu latuma bandu kulonge malobi gukuloba lukwali kwa bandu bi likabila la Benjamini babube babia mu lilibu luku Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Ndienu, kipindi aselase akanalomi buku Benjamini bakelubuka mu manyumba gabu nakwaapeke akakamwali bala buku Yabeshi Gileadi kola babahigali. Lakini akambomba bebala ngasebaatosi akanalomi bene.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Ndienu Aizilaeli baabonila ikia bandu bi likabila la Abenjamini ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwaabeki mpaka pikilanda ja bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ndienu akaaseja bi likundi loti bapwaga, “Ndaba akambomba bi likabila la Abenjamini baatei kwaakoma, tuhenga kii ili kwaapeke akambomba akanalomi haba baahigalile? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Babwaaga, kupalika akanalomi baahigali bi likabila la Abenjamini apata akambomba ili likabila labu liendalia na liihoba likabila lokapi kwa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Lakini ngatuwesi kwaapia aka kamwali bitu kuba aka ahanu babo, ndaba twalapiki kupwaga, mundu jokapi jojwampia kamwali waki kwa mwanalomi ju likabila la Benjamini kuba nhwanu waki jupata yaambamba.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Ndi bakombuka tipati jukunhenge isima Bambu Sapanga jejabia jihengeka kila saka ku Shilu kola, musi gogubi upandi uku kasikazini wa Beseli nu upandi golipiti lyoba mu indela ngolongu jejihuma ku Beseli nu kujenda ku Shekemu upandi ukusini uku Lebabnoni, jabia jitenda kuhegale. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Henu baalagalakia akanalomi bi likabila laka Benjamini bala, nzendania mwakajoba mu matui gi mizabibu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Nndingalia ana mwaabweni akakamwali buku Shilu hebiipita kunza nu kuliunga kuhina kipindi sa tipati, mpita mu mizabibu jejela na kila mundu jujukua kamwali jumu ili jubia nhwanu waki. Na mwiibuja nabu mu nndema uku likabila laka Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Atati babu au aka ahasa babu ana ahikiki kutulalamaki twaapwagila, mmbia ni ikia kwa bandu buku Benjamini na mutujetakaliya baajukua akakamwali bi haba, ndaba ngasetwaapatiki akakamwali bukutosa mu ngondu juku Yabeshi Gileadi. Lakini mwanganya ngasemmbii ni likosa kwa ndaba ngasemwaapeki akakamwali bii kuba akahanu babu.<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Akanalomi bi likabila la Benjamini bala bahenga ahelahela, kila jumu julihagulia kamwali jumu kati jakakamwali babapita kunza kukina ku Shilu kola nu kunzuku kuba nhwanu waki. Ndi babuja ku musi jabu na bijisenga kabee misi jabu nu kutama mola. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Kipindi aselasela Aizilaeli baboka, kila mundu jwajenda ku lieneu li likabila laki na alongu baki. Kila mundu jakelubuka mu pandu pabummbaguli.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Kipindi sela ngasepakabi na bambu nkolongu mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Kila mundu jwahenga ngati hejulibonila mweni kuba sapi.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>